<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Efik Living New Testament</book>
  <para style="rem">Copyright © 1995 by Biblica, Inc.</para>
  <para style="h">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ñwed Mak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ñwed Mak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Emi edi ntọñọ utibe mbuk Jisọs Andinyaña, Eyen Abasi. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Ke ñwed emi Asiak Uduak Abasi Aisaya ekewetde, Abasi ama ọnọ ntọt ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Ami ñyedọñ Eyen mmi edi ke ererimbot ndien ñyedọñ ata akpan isuñutom ebem Enye iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">editim ererimbot ebeñe edidi Esie.”<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />“Uyo ke ofiori ke isọñ utatan ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Ediọñ usuñ Ọbọñ ebeñe Enye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">enam nnen nnen usuñ enọ Enye ndisaña!”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jọn Enim Ababtisim</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Isuñutom emi ekedi Jọn enim owo Babtisim. Enye okodu ke isọñ utatan onyuñ ekpep ete yak kpukpru owo ena babtisim nte añwa añwa uwutñkpọ nte ke mmimọ imọwọñọde ikpọñ idiọkñkpọ, man oto do Abasi akpadahado ọnọ mmọ, <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Mme owo ema eto Jerusalem, ye ke ofuri isọñ Judia edi ke ukpọk isọñ Judia man ekekut enyuñ ekop se Jọn eketiñde. Ndien ke adañaemi mmọ ema ekeyarade mme idiọkñkpọ mmọ, enye ama onim mmọ babtisim ke akpa Jọdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Ekeda idet enañ emi ekotde Kamel edọk ọfọñidem Jọn. Enye onyuñ ọbọbọ mbọbọ isin ikpa unam; ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ ye aran ọkwọk ikọt ekedi udia esie. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Emi ekedi ukwọrọ ikọ esie: “Ibighike owo eyedi emi okponde akan mi. Enye okpon akan mi, nte ami mme ndotke ndi nuhọ ntat uruk ikpaukot Esie.<verse eid="MRK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ami nda mmọñ nnim mbufo babtisim, edi Enye edida Edisana Spirit Abasi inim mbufo babtisim!”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ntem usen kiet, Jisọs ama oto Nasaret ke Kalili edi, ndien Jọn ama onim Enye babtisim ke akpa Jọdan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ndo ndo oro Jisọs ọkọwọrọde ke mmọñ, Enye ama okut nte ikpa enyọñ ọkubọrede, ndien Edisana Spirit ke mbiet ibiom ọsuhọrede edisọrọ Enye ke idem. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ndien uyo ama oto ke enyọñ ọdọhọ ete, “Afo edi edima Eyen Mi, Afo edi ñkpọ inemesit Mi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ikebighike Edisana Spirit ama enyik Jisọs ndika isọñ utatan, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />ndien enye ama odu ke isọñ utatan ke usen aba, ndien setan ama odomo Enye. Enye okodu ye mme unam ikọt, ndien mme enjel ekese ñkpọ ebaña enye.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ke oro ama ekebe, ke adañaemi Edidem Erọd ama okomum Jọn, Jisọs ama adaha aka ke Kalili ndikọkwọrọ Eti Mbuk emi otode Abasi.<verse eid="MRK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Jisọs ọkọkwọrọ ete, “Ini emekem, Obio Ubọñ Abasi ekpere. Ekabade esit, enyuñ enim Eti Mbuk emi ke akpanikọ.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisọs Okot Ubak Mme Nsaña Esie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Usen kiet nte Jisọs akasañade ke mben akpa Kalili, Enye ama okut Saimọn ye eyen eka esie Andru nte ekọde iyak ye iyire, koro ubọk utom mmọ ekedide ukọiyak.<verse eid="MRK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jisọs ama esin uyo okot mmọ ete, “Edi, etiene Mi, ndien Ami ñyenam mbufo edi mme ọkọ ukpọñ owo.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Inikiet inikiet mmọ ema ekpọñ iyire mmọ enyuñ etiene Enye.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ke Enye ama akamana asaña akaiso esisit, Enye ama okut nditọ Sebidi, Jems ye Jọn, nte etiede ke ubom ediọñ iyire mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Enye ama okot mmọ ñko, ndien inikiet inikiet mmọ ema ekpọñ ete mmọ ye mme mbon emi ekekpedekpe esin ke ubom, ndien etiene Enye.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Jisọs ye mme nsaña Esie ema ekesim obio Kapanọm ndien ke usenubọk Satide Enye ama oduk ke ufọk mbono mme Ju onyuñ ọtọñọ ndikpep ñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Idem ama akpa kpukpru owo ke ukpepñkpọ Esie, koro enye ekekpepde mmọ ñkpọ nte enye emi enyenede ọyọhọ unen, idighe nte mme ekpep ibet mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekọk Mme Ekese Owo Udọñọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Owo kiet emi ndedehe spirit okomumde ama odu do, ke ufọk mbono oro, ndien enye ama ofiori ñkpo. <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Ntak emi Afo afinade ñnyin e? Jisọs eyen Nasaret, nte Afo edi ndisobo ñnyin mme ndedehe spirit? Ami mọdiọñọ owo emi afo edide, edi Edisana Eyen Abasi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Jisọs ama owuk ndedehe spirit emi, ete, “Kibi inua fo, ñnyuñ wọrọ kpọñ owo oro.” <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ke edikop uyo oro, ndedehe spirit oro ama ofiori onyuñ atuak owo oro ata ọkpọsọñ ndien ọwọrọ ọkpọñ enye. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Idem ama akpa otu owo eti eti, tutu mmọ ema ebup idem mmọ ete, “Nso idi emi? Nso obufa ukpep efen idi emi? Owo emi enyene odudu ndiwuk mme ndedehe spirit ndien mmọ esuk ibuot enọ enye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Etop utibe ñkpọ emi Enye akanamde ama asuana akanade ofuri ñkanñkuk Kalili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ndo ndo emi mmọ ekekpọñde ufọk mbono oro, Enye ama asaña ye Jems ye Jọn eka ke ufọk Saimọn ye Andru. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Eka añwan Saimọn ọkọdọdọñọ ana ke ñkpana ye ufiop idem, ndien mmọ ema esian Jisọs ebaña enye. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Enye ama asaña ekpere ñkpana esie, omum enye ke ubọk, onyuñ emenerede enye ke enyọñ. Ufiop idem ama okure enye ndien enye ama adaha ada onyuñ anam ñkpọ ọnọ mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Ke ini mbubreyo, esit okure ama ọyọhọ ye mbon udọñọ ye mbon emi ndedehe spirit omumde emi ekedade edi man enye ọkọk mmọ udọñọ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ofuri mbon obio oro ema ediboho ke enyinusuñ ufọk oro. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Jisọs ama ọkọk ediwak mbon oro udọñọ ke mbubreyo oro onyuñ ebin mme ndedehe spirit osioño ke idem mme mmọ emi ndedehe spirit ekemumde. Edi ikenyimeke mme ndedehe spirit oro etiñ ikọ koro mmọ ekedioñode utọ owo emi Enye ekedide.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ke ndañ nsiere Jisọs ama abak adahada ke ñkim ñwaña, onyuñ asaña ikpọñ aka ke isọñ utatan ndibọñ akam.<verse eid="MRK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Saimọn ye mme nsaña esie ema ewọñọ eka ndiyom Enye, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />ndien ke ini emi mmọ ekekutde Enye mmọ ema edọhọ Enye ete, “kpukpru owo ke eyom fi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Edi Enye ama ọbọrọ ete, “Ana ñnyin ika mme obio efen ñko ikọkwọrọ ikọ emi inọ mmọ, koro ke ntak emi ke Ami ñkedi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ntre Enye ama asaña akanade kpukpru obio ke Kalili ọkwọrọ ikọ ke ufọk mbono mmọ kiet kiet onyuñ atat ediwak owo ke ñkpọkọbi ndedehe spirit. <verse eid="MRK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Owo akpa mfia kiet ama editọñọ edọñ ke iso Jisọs, onyuñ ekpe Enye ubọk ete, “Edieke Afo edinyimede, Afo emekeme ndinam mi nsana.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jisọs ama ọyọhọ ye mbọm ndien otuk enye ubọk onyuñ ọdọhọ ete, “Ami menyime, sana!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ndo ndo oro akpamfia ama okure owo oro, enye onyuñ okop nsọñidem.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Jisọs ama osio enye unyọñ onyuñ oduri enye utọñ ete: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Kutiñ ñkpọ emi unọ owo ndomokiet ke usuñ, edi ka kowut oku Abasi idem fo, ñnyuñ nam uwa emi Moses ekenimde kabaña edinam mme akpamfia esana nte ñkpọ ntiense ke edibọhọ mmọ ke udọñọ emi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Edi nte owo emi akasañade ke usuñ ọnyọñ, enye aka ọtọñọ nditiñ añwa añwa onyuñ asuan mbuk emi. Ke ntak emi Jisọs ikekemeke aba ndiduk obio ndomokiet añwa añwa, edi Enye ekenyene ndidu ke edem obio ke ebiet emi owo ndomokiet miduñke. Kpa ye oro, mme owo ema eto kpukpru inuk ebine enye.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ke ñkpọ nte usen ifañ ema ekebe, Jisọs ama afiak aka ke Kapanọm ndien etop edifiak ndi Esie ama asuana usọp usọp akanade ofuri obio. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ikebighike-bighi ufọk emi Enye okodude ama ọyọhọ ye isenowo tutu itie ikọduhọ aba inọ idem owo kiet efen, kpa ye ke idem inua otop itie ikọduhọ. Ndien enye ama ọkwọrọ ikọ ọnọ mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Owo inañ emi ekebiomde ọdọñọ akpaubeñ ke ñkpana ema edisim. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mmọ ikekemeke ndisim Jisọs oto ke ntak otu owo, ke ntak oro mmọ ema ekubọde itie ke enyọñ ọkọm ufọk oro ke ukem ukem itie emi ibuot Jisọs akadade, ndien ema esuhọrede owo udọñọ oro ye ñkpana esie enim ke iso Jisọs.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ke ini Jisọs okokutde nte mmọ ekenimde ke akpanikọ nte ke Imọ imekeme ndinyaña, Enye ama ọdọhọ ọdọñọ akpaubeñ ete, “Eyen, emefen mme idiọkñkpọ fo!”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Edi ndusuk mme andikpep ibet mme Ju, ema etie do enyuñ ebup idem mmọ ete; <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Nso idi emi? Emi edi ndisabade Abasi! Mme enye ekere ete ke imọ idi Abasi? Koro edi Abasi ikpọñ ikpọñ ekeme ndifen mme idiọkñkpọ.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Jisọs ama ọdiọñọ ekikere esit mmọ ndien ama obup mmọ inikiet ete, “Nso idi ntak emi ñkpọ emi afinade mbufo?” <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Efe emem akan ndidọhọ akpaubeñ, “Emefen mme idiọkñkpọ fo” mme ndidọhọ nte, “Dahada ke enyọñ, men ñkpana fo ñnyuñ saña? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Edi man mbufo efiọk ete ke Eyen owo enyene odudu ke isọñ ndifen mme idiọkñkpọ,” <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />Enye ama ọdọhọ owo akpaubeñ emi ete, “Ami mmowuk fi, daha ke enyọñ, men ñkpana fo, nyuñ nyọñ ufọk fo, koro emenam udọñọ fo okure.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Owo emi ama adaha ke enyọñ inikiet, emen ñkpana esie onyuñ asaña ọwọrọ ke iso kpukpru owo. Idem ama akpa kpukpru owo ndien mmọ ema etoro Abasi enyuñ edọhọ ete, “Akananam ñnyin ikwe utọ ñkpọ emi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Jisọs ama ọtọñọ ntak aka ke mben akpa. Ata akwa otu owo ema ebine Enye ndien Enye ama ọtọñọ ndikpep mmọ ñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Nte Enye akasañade ke mben inyañ, Enye ama okut Lefai, eyen Alfiọs nte etiede ke efe ubọ ataksi. Jisọs ama ọdọhọ enye ete “Tiene Mi”, ndien Lefai ama adaha ada onyuñ etiene Enye.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ke ini emi Jisọs akadiade udia mbubreyo ke ufọk Lefai, ediwak mme ọbọ ataksi ye mme anam idiọkñkpọ ema ebuana udia ye Enye ye mme mbet esie koro mme mmọ emi eketienede Enye ekewakde. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Edi ke ini mme ekpep ibet emi ekedide mme Farisi ekekutde nte Enye adiade udia ye mme anam idiọkñkpọ ye mme ọbọ ataksi, mmọ ema ebup mme mbet Jisọs ete, “Nso idi ntak emi Enye adiade udia ye mme ọbọ ataksi ye mme anam idiọkñkpọ?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Ke ini Jisọs okokopde se mmọ eketiñde, Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Edi mbon udọñọ eyom abia ibọk, idighe mbon emi idem ọsọñde. Ami ñkedighe ndidọhọ mme nti owo ekabade esit, edi, ndi man mme anam idiọk ekabade esit.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owo Emi Otode Obio Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Mme mbet Jọn ye mme Farisi ema etre udia inikiet, do ke mme owo ekedibup Jisọs ete, “Nso idi ntak emi mme mbet Jọn ye eke mme Farisi esitrede udia edi mbet fo itreke?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete, “Nte mme ufan ebe ndọ ekeme nditre ndidia udia ke ini ebe ndo anamde usọrọ ndo? Nte mmọ ekpefefuhọ ke ini emi enye osuk odude ye mmọ? <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Edi ini eyedi emi edimende ebe ndọ ikpọñ mmọ, ndien ke usen oro, mmọ eyetre udia. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Ke ebede oro, utreudia edi akani ido usuñ unam ñkpọ kiet. Etie nte owo ndida obufa nsọñurua ọfọñ ñkim nsiri nde ntaha akani ọfọñ. Nso iditibe? Obufa ọfọñ eyefiak oduri akani ọfọñ awak ndien anam ọfọñ oro ọdiọk akan nte enye ekedide. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Owo baba kiet isinke obufa mmin ke akani ekpat ikpa unam usin mmin; edieke enye anamde ntre, mmin oro eyebom ekpat ikpa oro, ndien mmin ye ekpat ikpa unam eyetak. Baba! Obufa mmin oyom obufa ekpat ikpa unam.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ini efen, ke usen Sabat kiet, nte Jisọs akasañade ye mme mbet Esie ebe ke iñwañ ibokpot, mme mbet Esie ema etọñọ ndibuñ ibokpot ñnyuñ mbek ñkpasip esie nta.<verse eid="MRK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mme Farisi ema ebup Jisọs ete, “Nso idi ntak emi mmọ enamde se ebetdebet ke usen Sabat?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Edi Jisọs ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete, “nte akananam mbufo ikopke ibaña se Edidem Defid akanamde ke ini emi biọñ ọkọdọñde enye ye ikọt esie, mmọ ekenyuñ edude ke unana? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Nte enye okodukde ke esit ufọk Abasi ke ini emi Abiata ekedide akwa oku, ndien ata mme ebok uyo uwa emi mme oku ikpọñ ekenyenede ndita, ye nte enye ọkọnọde mmọ emi ekedude ye enye mme ubak uyo emi?” <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Do ke enye ọkọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ekenam Sabat enọ owo, ikanamke owo inọ Sabat <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ke ntre, Eyen Owo edi Ọbọñ emi akarade Sabat.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Jisọs ama afiak aka ufọk mbono mme Ju, ndien owo kiet emi ubọk esie akakpade ama odu do.<verse eid="MRK 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Sia ekedide ke usen Sabat mme asua Jisọs ema ekpeme Enye eti eti ndise mme Enye eyekọk ubọk owo oro. Edieke Enye anamde ntre mmọ ekpenyene isọñ ntak ndida ñkpe ikpe ye Enye.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ owo oro ubọk esie akakpade ete, “Wọrọ da mi ke iso kpukpru owo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ntem ke Enye ọkọwọñọde enyin ese mme asua Esie, onyuñ obup mmọ ete, “Efe enen ke usen Sabat ndinam: ndinam eti mme ndinam idiọk, ndinyaña uwem mme ndibabiat uwem?” Edi mmọ ikọnọhọ Enye ibọrọ. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Enye ama ọwọñọde ese mmọ ke enyin iyaresit, koro ama abiak Enye eti eti ndikut nte mmọ enanade esit mbọm, do ke Enye ọkọdọhọ owo oro ete, “Neñede ubọk fo”. Enye ama anam ntre, ndien ndo ndo oro ubọk esie ama enyene uwem, onyuñ eneñede<verse eid="MRK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Mme Farisi ema ewọñọ, ndien etọñọ ediomi ye mbon ñka Erọd nte mmọ edisañade iwot Jisọs. <verse eid="MRK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jisọs ye mme mbet Esie ema ediañade ekpọñ mmọ eka mben akpa Kalili, ndien akwa otu owo emi eketode Kalili, ye Judia ema etiene Enye. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Ke mmọ ema ekekop kpukpru se Enye akakade iso ndinam, ata ediwak owo ema eto Jerusalem, Iduma ye nsañade nda Jọdan ye mme obio Taya ye Sidọn ebine Enye.<verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ke ntak emi otu owo okokponde eti eti, Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mme mbet Esie enam ekpri ubom ekpere ọnọ imọ ndida ñwọrọ ñkpọñ otu owo edieke otu owo ọtọñọde ndifik imọ nsin. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Koro Enye ama ọkọk ediwak owo udọñọ, ndien mme mmọ emi edọñọde ke enuk akpan akpan ebine ndituk Enye.<verse eid="MRK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ini kiet ekededi emi mbon emi ndedehe spirit emumde ekekutde Enye, mmọ ekenyene ndiduọñọ ke isọñ enyuñ efiori ete, “Afo edi Eyen Abasi!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Edi Enye ama ọsọñọ owuk mmọ ete ekuyarade owo emi Imọ idide.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekot Mme Nsaña Utom Efen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ke emi ama ekebe, Enye ama ọdọk aka ke enyọñ obot, onyuñ okot mmọ emi Enye ekemekde etiene Enye, ndien mmọ ema etiene Enye. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Enye ama emek owo duopeba osio ke otu mmọ ndidi mme nsaña Esie ofuri ini, ye ndinyuñ ñka ñkọkwọrọ ikọ, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />ye ndinyene odudu ndibin mme ekpo nsioño mme owo ke idem.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Mme owo duopeba emi Enye ekemekde edi emi: Saimọn (emi Enye okosiode enyiñ Pita).<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jems ye eyen eka esie Jọn, nditọ Sebidi (Jisọs ama ọnọ mmọ enyiñ Boanakes, emi ọwọrọde nditọ obuma), <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andru, Filip, Batolomiu, Matiu, Tọmọs, Jems eyen Alfiọs, Tadiọs, Saimọn (owo ñka ukara emi eyomde ufọn obio mmọ).<verse eid="MRK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Ye Judas Iskariọt emi akatabde Jisọs ọnọ ñkpa.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Jisọs ama ọnyọñ ufọk ndien otu owo emi eketọñọde ntak eboho ama okpon eti eti, anam Enye ye mbet Esie ikenyeneke ufañ ye ifet ndidia udia. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ke ini oruk ye iman Esie ekekopde se ikakade iso emi, mmọ ema eka man ekeda Enye enyọñ ufọk, koro mmọ ekedọhọde ete, “Ibuot abiara Enye.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Edi mme andikpep ikọ Abasi mme Ju emi eketode Jerusalem edi ema etiñ ete, mfina Esie edi koro ndedehe spirit omumde Enye, edidem mme ndedehe spirit, oro edi ntak emi mme ndedehe spirit esukde ibuot enọ Enye.<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Jisọs ama okot kpukpru mmọ obon ọtọ kiet onyuñ obup mmọ ke ñke emi kpukpru mmọ ekediọñọde ete, “Didie ke Setan ekeme ndibin Setan? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Obio ekededi emi abaharede ada añwana ye idem esie, ọyọduọ. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ufọk emi ọyọhọde ye ufup, mme ubahade odude ke esit, owuri idem esie. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ndien edieke Setan añwanade ye idem esie, didie ndien ke enye ekeme ndinam ñkpọ ndomokiet? Enye idikemeke ndisọñọ nda. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Ke akpanikọ owo baba kiet ikemeke ndiduk ufọk ọkpọsọñ owo ntañ ñkpọ esie, ibọhọke enye ebem iso omum ọkpọsọñ owo oro ọbọp ndien enye ekeme ndiduk ufọk odo ntañ ñkpọ esie. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ke akpanikọ ke ndọhọ mbufo nte ke eyefen kpukpru idiọkñkpọ kiet ekededi enọ owo kpa ye editiñ ikọ isuñi ndian Mi. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Edi ama edi editiñ ikọ isuñi ndian Edisana Spirit ikemekekeme ndidahado nnọ owo oro; koro enye anamde nsinsi idiọkñkpọ.”<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Enye eketiñ ikọ emi ọnọ mmọ koro mmọ ekedọhọde ete ke Enye akanam kpukpru utibe idiọñọ Esie oto odudu Setan (utu ke mmọ ekpedọhọ ete ke oto ke odudu Edisana Spirit).<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ekem eka Jisọs, nditọ eka ye nditọ ete Esie iren ema edisim. Mmọ ekeda ke añwa ndien edọñ owo oduk okokot Enye. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Otu owo ema etie ekanade Jisọs, ndien mmọ ema edọhọ Enye ete, “Eka fo, nditọ ete ye nditọ eka fo iren mmọ ke añwa ke eyom fi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Anie edi eka mi? Mme anie edi nditọ ete ye nditọ eka mi iren? <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Enye ama emenede enyin ese mme owo oro eketiede ekanade Enye onyuñ ọdọhọ ete, ‘Emi edi eka mi ye mme nditọ ete ye nditọ eka mi iren.’ <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Owo kiet ekededi emi anamde se Abasi oyomde enye anam edi eyen ete mi eren, eyen eka mi añwan ye eka mi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Inikiet efen, Jisọs ama ọtọñọ ndikpep ñkpọ ke mben ñkpọdiọhọ mmọñ Kalili. Otu owo emi ekebohode ekanade Enye ama okpon eti eti, anam Enye ama oduk ke ubom onyuñ ọsuhọde etetie. Ubom ama asaña ọwọrọ ọkpọñ mben ke ini otu owo ekedade ke obot ke mben mmọñ. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Enye ama ekpep mmọ ediwak ñkpọ ke ñke, ndien ke ukpepñkpọ Esie, Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Ekpañ utọñ! Ọtọ iñwañ ama ọwọrọ aka ndisuan ñkpasip esie. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Nte enye akasuande ñkpasip ke iñwañ, ndusuk mmọ ema eduọñọ ke mben ọkpọusuñ ndien mme inuen enyọñ ema editañ mmọ eta. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ndusuk ema eduọñọ ke isọñ itiat, ebiet emi ntan ekedide esisit. Mme ñkpasip oro ema etọñọ ndikọri usọp usọp koro ntan okodude enyọñ enyọñ. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ndien ke ini utin akasiahade, ama ọfọp mmọ, ndien sia mme oruñ mmọ mikọsuhọkede iduk isọñ nte ekemde, mmọ ema eyemede ekpaña. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ndusuk ñkpasip ema eduọñọ ke otu mme ñkukim emi ekekọride enyuñ efuk mmọ anam mmọ ikoñwumke mfri. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Edi ndusuk ñkpasip ema eduọñọ ke eti isọñ, mmọ ema etibe, ekọri enyuñ eñwum mfri. Ndusuk ikedip ye duop, ndusuk ata ye ndusuk eken utim ikie ikie. <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Edieke mbufo enyenede utọñ, ekpañ utọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ke oro ama ekebe ke ini emi Enye okodude ikpọñ ye mbet Esie duopeba ye mme mmọ efen eken (ọdiọñọ Esie), mmọ ema ebup Enye ete, “Ñke Fo ọwọrọ nso?”<verse eid="MRK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Enye ama etiñ ọnọ mmọ ete, emeyarade ndibe ñkpọ Obio Ubọñ enọ mbufo ndifiọk, edi ama edi mmọ emi minyeneke udeme ke Obio Ubọñ Abasi, etiñ kpukpru ñkpọ enọ ke ñke. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Man oto do mmọ ekpekaiso ese, edi ikemeke ndikut, enyuñ ekaiso ndikokop edi ifiọkke se ọwọrọde. Ke ebede oro, mmọ ekpewọñọde etiene Abasi, ndien ekpedahado enọ mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ndien Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Nte mbufo ifiọkke se ñke emi ọwọrọde? Didie ndien ke mbufo edifiọk se ñke kiet ekededi ọwọrọde?<verse eid="MRK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Ọtọ iñwañ emi edi owo kiet ekededi emi emende Etop Abasi ọsọk mbon efen, osuk añwanade nditọ nti ñkpasip ke uwem mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Mben ọkpọusuñ emi ndusuk ñkpasip ekeduọñọde ada ọnọ esit ndusuk owo emi ekopde ikọ Abasi, ndien Setan edisioño kpukpru ikọ oro efep ke esit mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Isọñ itiat ada ọnọ esit mmọ emi ekopde ikọ Abasi enyuñ ebọ inikiet ye ata idaraesit. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Edi sia mmọ minyeneke oruñ, ebighi ke esisit ini. Ke ini mfina ye ukọbọ edide ke ntak ikọ oro, mmọ eduọ ekpọñ usuñ inikiet.<verse eid="MRK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Isọñ ñkukim ada ọnọ esit mmọ emi ekpañde utọñ enọ Eti Etop Obio Ubọñ Abasi ndien ebọ. <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Edi mfina uwem emi, ima inyene, ye udọñitọñ edinyene ediwak mme nsio nsio ñkpọ eken ekọri efuk ikọ Abasi, anam mmọ ikemeke ndiñwum mfri ndomokiet.<verse eid="MRK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Edi eti isọñ ada ọnọ esit mmọ emi ekopde ikọ Abasi ndien eñwum ediwak mfri enọ Abasi ke itie edip ye duop ye itie ata mme edide idem itie ikie ke adaña nte eketọde enye ke esit mmọ.” <verse eid="MRK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Ndien Jisọs obup mmọ ete, “Nte owo ekeme ndidomo utueneikañ ñnyuñ mmen nsin ke edem abañ? Nte enye idimenke idori ke ñkpọ udori utueneikañ?<verse eid="MRK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Koro eyeyarade kpukpru se idibede, enyuñ efuhọde kpukpru se ekefukde eda ewọrọ ke uñwana. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Edieke enyenede utọñ, ekop.” <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Enye ama onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Etim ekere eti eti se ekopde, koro kpa udomo emi edade edomo enọ mbon efen ke edida idomo inọ mbufo, akan idem nte mbufo ekedomode.” <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ama edi enye emi enyenede, eyedian ediwak enọ enye enyuñ ebọ eto enye emi minyeneke se enye ekenyenede.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Enye ama onyuñ etiñ ete, “Obio Ubọñ Abasi etie nte ọtọ iñwañ emi asuande ñkpasip ke iñwañ esie. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ndien enye adaha ọnyọñ ufọk esie ndien ke ñkpọ nte ediwak usen ama ekebe, ñkpasip oro etibe enyuñ ekọri edi ibọhọ uñwam ndomokiet ito enye. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Koro edi isọñ akanam ñkpasip oro ọkọri. Ebem iso etibe nsehe ikọñ, ndien editop idem, ndien ke akpatre mfri oro adat. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Akpa ifet emi mfri oro adatde, ọtọ iñwañ emen ofut esie ọtọñọ utom koro ini ukpeñe ekem.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Nso ke ndikeme ndida ndomo Obio Ubọñ Abasi añwaña mbufo, mme nso oruk mbuk ñke ke ñkeme ndida ndomo nte Obio Ubọñ Abasi etiede man añwaña? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Enye etie nte ñkpasip eto emi ekotde mọstad, okposuk edi emi enye edide kiet ke otu mme ñkpasip emi ekpride akan, edi ke ini owo emende enye ọtọ ke isọñ, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />enye ọkọri, onyuñ akabade edi akwa eto, emi okponde akan kpukpru mme eto, ye mme ikpọ ñkọk nte mme inuen enyọñ ekemede ndibọp efọk ñnyuñ nduñ ke esit.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Enye ama ada mme nsio nsio mbuk ñke efen ntre ekpep mme owo ñkpọ ediwak ini adaña nte mmọ ekekemede ndifiọk. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Enye esitiñ kpukpru ikọ ọnọ mmọ ke ñke. Edi kadaña emi Enye esidude ikpọñ, Enye esinyene ndinam mmọ efiọk se mbuk Esie ewọrọde.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ke mbubreyo usen oro, Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mbet Esie ete, “Eyak ñnyin iwat ibe inyañ ika edem inyañ oko.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ntre ke mmọ ekeda Enye kpasuk nte Enye eketiede ke ubom ndien etọñọ uwot isañ, ekpọñ otu owo ke edem (okposuk edi emi mme ubom efen eketienede mmọ ke edem); <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Edi ikebighike ọkpọsọñ oyobio ama otibe. Ọkpọsọñ mbufut mmọñ ama ọtọñọ ndidaha ñnyuñ nduk esit ubom tutu mmọñ ekpere ndiyọhọ esit ubom ñnyuñ nnam enye osip ke inyañ ibom. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Jisọs akana ke etak ubom ede idap, odori ibuot ke udori ibuot. Ke ata esit ndik, mmọ ema eketuak enyuñ edemere Enye ke idap ete, “Eteufọk, nte Afo ukereke ete ke ñnyin imọñ itak ke inyañ?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Ntem ke Enye akadahada asua ọnọ ofim onyuñ ọdọhọ inyañ ete, “Na suñ-ñ-ñ!” Ndien ofim ye inyañ edobo, oyobio ye mbufut mmọñ ñko edop ena.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Enye obup mbet Esie ete, “Nso idi ntak emi mbufo efehede ndik? Nte mbufo isuk inyeneke mbuọtidem ke idem Mi?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ndien kpukpru mmọ ema eyọhọ ye ọkpọsọñ ndik enyuñ etiñ ke otu mmọ ete, “Anie edi owo emi; emi kpa ofim ye mbufut inyañ ibom, ekopde uyo Esie?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Mmọ ema ewat ebe inyañ ekebehe ke ñkanñkuk Kerasenesi ke edem ñkpọdiọhọ mmọñ eken. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jisọs okonyuñ ọsọsuhọ ke ubom, owo emi ọkọyọhọde ye ndedehe spirit ama ọwọrọ ke ikọt udi edi ndisobo ye Enye.<verse eid="MRK 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Owo emi okoduñ ke ikọt udi, ndien baba owo ndomokiet ikekemeke aba ndibọp enye, ukpọk ke ñkpọkọbi. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Esibọbọp enye ubọk ye ukot ediwak ini, edi enye esinyene ndibuñ ñkpọkọbi mme ebuka oro mbai mbai. Owo ikọduhọ emi ekekemede ndikan enye. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ke kpukpru uwemeyo ye okoneyo enye okodu ndiyo nsaña ke ikọt udi ye ke mme enyọñ obot, kofiori ñkpo, onyuñ ada itiat emi ọsọpde ekpeñe idem esie ọnọ unan.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ke ini enye akadade okut Jisọs ko nsan nsan, enye ama efehe ọkọduọ ke edọñ ke iso Esie.<verse eid="MRK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Enye ama ofiori ke ọkpọsọñ uyo ete, “Nso ke afo enyene ndinam ye ami, Jisọs Eyen Abasi Ibom? Mmekpe fi ubọk ke enyiñ Abasi nte yak okutuhọde mi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Enye eketiñ emi koro Jisọs ọkọdọhọde enye ete, “wọrọ enye ke idem afo idiọk spirit.”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Jisọs ama obup enye ete, “Afo ekere didie?” Ndien owo oro ama ọbọrọ ete, “Udim” koro ediwak ñnyin isinede owo emi ke idem.<verse eid="MRK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ntem ke enye akakaiso ekpe Jisọs ubọk ete yak Enye okubin mmimọ osioño ke ñkanñkuk oro.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Idaha oro nte ñkpọ okosuk akade iso, ama odu ata akamba udim edi emi ekesuk ediade ñkpọ ke ñkañ obot obot. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Mme ndedehe spirit oro ema ebeñe Jisọs ete, “Dọñ ñnyin ikoduk ke idem mme edi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Ndien Jisọs ama ọnọ mmọ edinyime. Ntem ke mme ndedehe spirit oro ekewọñọ ekpọñ owo oro enyuñ ekeduk mme edi oro ke idem, ndien ofuri udim edi oro ema efeñe esuhọde ebedeñ eduọñọ ke inyañ enyuñ ekpaña ke mmọñ.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Mme andibọk edi ema efeñe eka mme ñkpet ñkpet obio ye ñkanñkuk esie, enyuñ esuan mbuk nte mmọ ekefeñede, ndien kpukpru owo ema efeñe ewọñọ edi man edikut ikpọñ ke idem mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ndien ikebighike akwa otu owo ema esop idem ke ebiet emi Jisọs okodude, edi mmọ ema ekut owo oro etiede do, esine ọfọñidem esie ukem ukem, onyuñ ọdiọñọ idem esie, (nte enyene ibuot eti owo) ndik ama anam mmọ eti eti. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Mbio emi ekekutde se iketibede ema eka iso ndibuk nnọ kpukpru owo se iketibede ye owo emi ọkọyọhọde ye ndedehe spirit, ye se iketibede ye udim edi ñko. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ndien mmọ ema etọñọ ndikpe Jisọs ubọk ete yak enye ọnyọñ esie, ọkpọñ ñkanñkuk mmimọ. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Ntem ke Enye akafiak okoduk ubom. Ndien owo emi mme ndedehe spirit ekewọñọde ama ekpe Jisọs ubọk ete, yak enye ayak imọ itiene Enye inyọñ, <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Jisọs ikenyimeke, edi ama ọdọhọ enye ete.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:19">“Nyọñ ufọk bine ikọt mbufo ñnyuñ kasian mmọ utibe ñkpọ emi Abasi anamde ọnọ fi ye adaña nte Enye akatuade fi mbọm.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ntre ke owo oro ọkọtọñọ ndisaña ñkanade mme obio duop emi ekedude ke ñkañ oro onyuñ asian kpukpru owo mme utibe ñkpọ emi Jisọs akanamde ọnọ enye, ndien idem ama akpa kpukpru owo emi ekekopde mbuk esie.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Edi ke Jisọs ama akawat ke ubom ebe aka edem ñkpọdiọhọ mmọñ eken, akwa otu owo ema eboho ekanare Enye ekuk ke mben mmọñ.<verse eid="MRK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Kiet ke otu mme ada usuñ ke ufọk mbono mme Ju emi okodude do; emi ekekerede Jairọs ama edi, ediduọ Jisọs ke ukot. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Ekpe Enye ubọk ete anam eyen imọ añwan okop nsọñidem, koro enye ekpere ndikpa. Enye etiñ ye ọkpọsọñ esit mfuhọ ete, “Mbọk di, didori enye ubọk ke idem nyuñ nam enye odu uwem.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Jisọs ama asaña ye enye aka ndien otu owo ema etiene enye ke edem. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Ke otu mme owo oro, ñwan kiet ama odu emi ọkọdọñọde udọñọ uwọrọ iyip, ke ñkpọ nte isua duopeba. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Enye ama ọbọ ndutuhọ ke ediwak isua ke ubọk mme mbiaibọk, onyuñ akabade edi ubuene ke ntak edibiat ediwak okuk nnọ mmọ, edi ikọfọnke ye enye, utu ke oro eketetim ọdiọk. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Enye ama okop abaña kpukpru mme utibe idiọñọ emi Jisọs akanamde, ntre enye ama afaha oduk ebine Jisọs edem edem ke otu owo, onyuñ okotuk ọfọñidem Esie.<verse eid="MRK 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Koro enye ekekerede ke esit esie ete, “Mma ñkam ntotuk ọfọñidem Esie, ami ñyekop nsọñidem.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ndien kpa ke idaha oro, akpaifet emi enye okotukde Enye ọfọñidem, uwọrọ iyip esie ama etre, ndien enye ama ọdiọñọ ete ke idem imọ ọsọñ.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Jisọs ama ọdiọñọ ini kiet ete ke odudu ukọk udọñọ ọwọrọ Imọ ke idem, ntre ke Enye ekese akanade otu owo onyuñ obup ete, “Anie otuk ọfọñidem Mi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Mme mbet Esie ema edọhọ ete, ofuri otu owo emi ke eda ekanade Fi ekuk ntem, ndien Afo obup ete, “Anie okotuk Mi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Edi Jisọs ama aka iso ese akanade, ndikut owo emi okotukde Enye. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Eyen añwan emi ama otim ọfiọk se iketibede ye enye, ntre enye ama ọwọrọ edi ke ñnyekidem ye ndik onyuñ emen ofuri akpanikọ etiñ ọnọ Jisọs. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ndien Jisọs asian enye ete, “Eyen añwan, mbuọtidem fo amanam fi okop nsọñidem, nyọñ ke emem, ñnyuñ bọ edikọk.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Nte Enye okosuk akade iso nditiñ ikọ ye enye, isuñutom ama oto ufọk Jairọs edisim ye etop ete ke mmọ ema ebiat ini ekaha ke eyen esie añwan ama akpa ndien inyeneke ntak ndomokiet emi Jisọs akpasañade ye enye aka ufọk esie idaha oro aba. <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Edi Jisọs ikikereke ibaña se mmọ eketiñde, edi ama ọdọhọ Jairọs ete, “Kufehe ndik. Kam nim ke akpanikọ.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ndien Jisọs anam otu owo etuak eda ndien iyakke baba owo ndomokiet etiene Enye eka ufọk Jairọs ibọhọke Pita ye Jems ye Jọn. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ke ini mmọ ema ekesim ufọk Jairọs Jisọs ama okut ete ke kpukpru ñkpọ okodu ke ndutime ye ọkpọsọñ editua eyet ye ufiori ñkpo. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Enye ama oduk esit ufọk onyuñ obup mmọ ete, “Nsidi ntak kpukpru ntuaña ye uyom emi? Eyen añwan emi ikpahakpa, edi enye edede.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mmọ ema esak Enye eti eti, edi Enye ọdọhọ kpukpru mmọ ewọñọ ke ufọk oro, ndien Enye ama ada ete ye eka ekpri eyen añwan oro ye mbet Esie ita, onyuñ oduk esit ubet emi eyenañwan oro akanade.<verse eid="MRK 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Enye ama omum enye ke ubọk onyuñ ọdọhọ ete. “Talita, Kumi,” (emi ọwọrọde ete, “Ekpri eyen añwan ndọhọ fi nte dahada ke enyọñ”). <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Enye ama adahada ini kiet onyuñ asaña akanade (enye ekedi enyen isua duopeba), idem ama akpa mme owo eti eti ke se iketibede emi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Enye ama oduri mmọ utọñ ete yak ekunam owo ndomokiet ọdiọñọ abaña edinam emi, onyuñ ọnọ uyo ete yak enọ eyen oro udia adia.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Ke esisit ini ama ekebe Enye ama ọwọrọ ọkpọñ idut oro onyuñ asaña ye mbet Esie afiak ọnyọñ ke Nasaret, obio emana Esie. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ke usen ikọ Abasi mme Ju, Enye ama oduk ke ufọk ukpono Abasi mme Ju, onyuñ ọtọñọ ndikpep ñkpọ, ndien idem ama akpa ediwak mmọ emi ekekpañde utọñ enọ Enye. Mmọ enyuñ ebup ete, “Enye ada kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi oto mmọñ? Nso oruk ifiọk ke enọ Enye emi, emi Enye adade anam mme utibe ñkpọ!<verse eid="MRK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nte idighe Enye edi eyen kapinta, emi Meri amande, eyen eka Jems, Josef, Judas ye Saimọn? Nte nditọ eka Esie iban ñko iduñọke mi ye ñnyin?” Ntre mmọ ema ekop idiọk esit ebaña Enye.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Ntem ke Jisọs ọkọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ekpekpono oku Abasi ke kpukpru ebiet, ke mibọhọke ke obio emana Esie, ye ke otu nditọ ete ye mbon esit ufọk esie.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Ndien okoto ke ntak emi mmọ mikenimke ke akpanikọ, anam Enye ikekemeke ndinam ediwak mme utibe idiọñọ ke otu mmọ ibọhọke ndidori mbon udọñọ ifañ ubọk ke idem ñnyuñ nnam mmọ ekop nsọñidem. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Ama odu Enye ke ata ñkpaidem ndikut nte mmọ etrede ndinim ke akpanikọ. Ntem ke Enye ọkọwọrọ asaña ke mme obio iñwañ efen ndikpep ñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Ndien Enye okot kpukpru mme mbet Esie duopeba obon ọtọ kiet onyuñ osioño mmọ owo iba iba ọdọñ onyuñ ọnọ mmọ odudu ndibin mme ndedehe spirit nsioño. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Enye ama ọnọ mmọ uyo ete, “Ekukama ñkpọ ndomokiet ke isañ mbufo ibọhọke esañ, ekukama uyo, ekpat, mme okuk ke mme ekpat mbufo. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Esine ikpaukot ke ukot mbufo, edi ekukama ukpuhọ ọfọñ ndomokiet.<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, Ufọk ekededi emi edidukde edu do tutu mbufo ekpọñ obio oro. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Ndien ke ebiet ekededi ke obio emi mme owo minyimeke ndidara mbufo, minyuñ imaha ndikpañ utọñ nnọ mbufo, ekeñ ntan ikpat mbufo ebon do ke adaña ini nte mbufo ekpọñde mmọ. Oro eyedi idiọñọ nduri utọñ ọnọ mmọ.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ntre ke mbet esie ekewọñọ eka, eketiñ enọ kpukpru owo emi mmọ ekekutde ete yak mmọ ekabade esit ekpọñ idiọkñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ndien mmọ ema ebin ediwak ndedehe spirit esioño enyuñ ekọk ediwak mbon udọñọ ndien eyet mmọ aran ke ibuot.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Ikebighike edidem Erọd ama okop abaña Jisọs, koro ema etiñ ebaña mme utibe idiọñọ Esie ke kpukpru ebiet. Edidem ekekere ete ke ekedi Jọn enim owo babtisim akafiak eset ke ñkpa. Ntre ke mme owo ekedọhọ ete, “Imosuk ise nte Enye ekemede ndinam kpukpru mme utibe ñkpọ emi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Ndusuk mme owo ema edọhọ ete ke Jisọs ekedi Elaiya, akwa prọfet Abasi eke eset, ndien idaha emi, Enye afiak eset odu uwem, edi ndusuk esuk eka iso eda Enye nte obufa prọfet Abasi emi etiede nte ñkani mme prọfet Abasi eke eset.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ke ini Erọd okokopde emi enye ama ọdọhọ ete, “Jọn, owo emi ñkesibede ibuot. Enye eset ke ñkpa ọtọñọ ntak odu uwem.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Erọd ke idem esie ọkọnọ uyo ete yak emum Jọn ebọp enyuñ esin enye ke ufọk ñkpọkọbi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Koro Jọn akasuade ọnọ enye ete ke ifọnke enye ndidọ ñwan eyen ete esie, Filip. <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Erọdias ama oyom ndiwot Jọn ke usiene, edi enye ikekemeke, sia Erọd mikenyimeke ewot enye. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Ndien Erọd ama okpono Jọn eti eti koro enye ọkọdiọñọde ete ke enye ọfọn onyuñ edi edisana owo ndien ntre enye ama onim enye ke idak ukpeme esie. Ekikere esitimede Erọd ini kiet ekededi emi enye esikopde uyo Jọn, edi okposuk edi ekedide ntre, enye okosuk amama ndikpañ utọñ nnọ ukwọrọ ikọ esie ke inemesit.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ke akpatre, Erọdias ama enyene usuñ esie. Ekedi ke ini usọrọ emana Erọd, enye akanam usọrọ ọnọ mme ikọt ufọk esie, ikpọ mme etubom mbon ekọñ ye ikpọ mme ọwọrọ iso nditọ isọñ ke Kalili.<verse eid="MRK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Eyen Erọdias, ñwan, ama oduk edi, onyuñ enek unek ke usuñ emi ekenemde Erọd ye mme isenowo esie esit eti eti, anam edidem ama ọdọhọ enye ete, “Beñe mi ñkpọ ekededi emi oyomde, ndien ami ñyenọ fi.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Enye ama ọsọñọ ọñwọñọ ete, “ñkpọ ekededi emi edibeñede, ñyenọ fi, ekpededi ubak obio mi ñkañ kiet.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Enye ama ọwọrọ okobup eka esie ete, “Nso ñkpọ ke ñkpebeñe?” Enye ama ọbọrọ enye ete, “Ibuot Jọn enim owo babtisim.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Enye ama ọsọp idem inikiet afiak ebine edidem onyuñ ekebeñe ete, “Ñyom ọnọ mi ibuot Jọn enim owo babtisim idaha emi ke akwa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Ntem ke Edidem ọkọfuhọ ke esit esie, edi but ama anam enye ndibiat uñwọñọ esie ke iso mme isenowo esie. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ntre ke enye ọkọdọñ kiet ke otu mbon ekọñ esie ete aka ke ufọk ñkpọkọbi ekesibe ibuot Jọn emen ọsọk imọ. Owo ekọñ oro ama okowot Jọn ke ufọk ñkpọkọbi, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />ndien ama ada ibuot Jọn edi ke akwa, ediyak ọnọ eyenañwan emi, ndien enye ama emen enye ọsọk eka esie.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ke ini mme mbet Jọn ekekopde se iketibede emi, mmọ ema ekemen okpo esie ekebuk ke udi.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Mbet Jisọs duopeba ke idaha emi ema enyọñ isañ ukwọrọ ikọ mmọ edi, ndien ebine Jisọs enyuñ ekesian enye se mmọ ekenamde ye se mmọ eketiñde enọ mme owo ekededi emi mmọ ekesobode.<verse eid="MRK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Ntem ke Jisọs akanam ekikere ete, “Eyak ñnyin ikpọñ otu owo esisit ika ikọduọk odudu.” Koro ediwak ke ededi, enyuñ enyenyọñọ, ndien baba ifet ndomokiet iduhọ inọ ñnyin ndidia ukpọk udia. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ntre ke mmọ ekeduk ubom ewat ewọrọ eka ebiet emi uyom miduhe. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Edi ediwak owo ema ekut nte mmọ edahade, ndien mmọ ema efeñe obot obot ebe ke mme obio ke mben inyañ ebem mmọ iso ekesim ebiet emi mmọ ekekade. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ntre ke akwa otu owo kpa nte ido esidide, ekeda do ebet mbemiso Enye ọwọrọ ke ubom. Ndien Enye ama okop mmọ mbọm koro mmọ ekebietde mme erọñ eke minyeneke andikpeme. Enye ama ekpep mmọ ediwak ñkpọ emi mmọ ekeyomde ndidiọñọ mbaña.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Edi ke ini akade ko, mme mbet Esie ema eka ebine Enye enyuñ ekedọhọ Enye ete, “Ebiet emi edi isọñ utatan, ndien ini ababiara. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Dọñ mme owo emi eka ke mme ñkpri obio emi ekperede ye mme obio iñwañ, ekedep se mmọ edidiade.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Edi Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Mbufo ke idem mbufo enọ mmọ ñkpọ edia.” Mmọ ema ebup Enye ete, “Nte ñnyin inyene ndika ñkedep udia ke bọn ikie iba nda ndinọ mmọ emi edia?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Udia emi ñnyin inyenede awak didie? Eka ekeduñọde efiọk. Mmọ ema efiak edidọhọ Enye ete ke edi uyo ition ye iyak iba.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Ndien Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mbet Esie ete yak enam mme owo ebahade idem mmọ esin ke otu, ke otu, enyuñ esuhọde etetie ke awawa mbiet. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Ndien mme owo ema etetie ke udim, owo ikie ikie, ye aba ye duop aba, ke otu ke otu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Enye ama emen ebok uyo ition emi ye iyak iba, ndien Enye ama emenerede enyin Esie ese enyọñ, ọnọ ekọm onyuñ obuñ mme uyo odo. Enye ama emen ọnọ mbet Esie edeme enọ otu owo. Enye ama onyuñ edeme iyak ọnọ kpukpru mmọ ñko. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Ndien kpukpru owo oro ema edia udia eyuhọ.<verse eid="MRK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Ndien mme mbet ema etañ mme mbeñe uyo ye eke iyak ọyọhọ akpasa duopeba. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ekedi tọsin irenowo ition ekedia udia oro.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ndo ndo oro ke ñkpọ emi ama ekebe, Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mbet Esie eduk ke ubom, ebem Enye iso ewat ebe inyañ eka ke Betsaida, ke ini Enye ke idem Esie enyenede ndisuan otu owo ñnyuñ nnam mmọ enyọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ke Enye ama akanam mmọ enyọñọ, ekem Enye ama adaha aka ke obot ndibọñ akam. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ke usuhọde mbubreyo, ubom okodu ke ufọt ñkpọdiọhọ mmọñ, ke ini Jisọs ọkọsuhọde ikpọñ ke obot. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Ndien Enye ama okut ete ke mmọ ekedu ke ata akamba afanikọñ, ke emi ofum ọkọwọrọde ọbọi iso mmọ ke enyuñ eñwana ye ofum ye mbufit mmọñ inyañ ibom. Edi ke ñkpọ nte ñkanika ita usenubọk, Enye ama asaña ke enyọñ mmọñ oyom ndibe. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Edi ke ini mmọ ekekutde Enye asañade ke enyọñ ñkpọdiọhọ mmọñ mmọ ema efiori ke ọkpọsọñ ndik koro mmọ ekekerede ete ke Enye ekedi ekpo. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Koro kpukpru mmọ ema ekut Enye, ndien ndik ama anam mmọ eti eti. Ke ndo ndo oro Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Esọñ esit, edi Ami. Ekufehe ndik.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ndien Enye ama asaña ọkọdọk oduk esit ubom ndien mbufit inyañ odobo ana suñ-ñ. Mme mbet Esie ekedu ke ata ñkpa idem, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />koro mmọ mikọfiọkke se idiọñọ mme eboho uyo oro ọkọwọrọde, koro ikike mmọ okosuk odude ke ekim.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ke ini mmọ ema ekedibehe ke Kenesaret, ke mben inyañ eken, mmọ ema eyiri ubom mmọ do ke esuk. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Mmọ ekenyuñ ewewọñọ ke ubom edọk obot, mme owo emi ekedade ekanade do, ema ediọñọ Jisọs ini kiet. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Ntre mmọ ema efeñe ekanade ofuri ñkanñkuk oro, enyuñ emen mme mbio udọñọ ke mme mbri mmọ eka ebiet ekededi emi mmọ ekekopde ete Enye odu. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ebiet ekededi emi Enye akakade ke ñkpri ye mme ikpọ obio, ye ke obio iñwañ, mmọ ema ekebon mbon udọñọ ke mme añwa urua ye mme efak obio, ndien ekpe Enye ubọk ete yak Enye ayak mmimọ ikam itotuk mben ọfọñidem Esie ndien adaña ediwak mbon udọñọ emi eketukde mben ọfọñidrm esie ema ekop nsọñidem.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Mbon ñka mme Farisi ye ndusuk mme andikpep ibet emi eketode Jerusalem edi, ema eboho ekanade Jisọs. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Mmọ ema ekut ete ke ndusuk mme mbet Jisọs ikeyetke ubọk, oro edi ikimaha ndinam kpukpru se edu ukpono Abasi mme Ju eketemede ete enam mbemiso edia udia. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Koro mme Ju, akpanakpan mme Farisi ikemeke ndidia udia ke mmọ miyetke ubọk mmọ tutu osim ekuñ ubọk mmọ kpa nte edu eset mmọ okoyomde. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ke ini mmọ esinyọñde urua edisim ufọk mmọ esinyene ndiyet ñkpọ ekededi emi mmọ edade enyọñ urua mbemiso mmọ edia. Emi edi kiet ke otu ediwak mme uwutñkpọ ye ewuhọ emi mmọ emumde ekama toto ke eset, ndien esuk eka iso enam oruk ñkpọ nte ediyet mme kọb, esio ye mme usan udia.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ntre mme ada usuñ ukpono Abasi mme Ju ema ebup Jisọs ete, “Ntak edi nso emi mme mbet Fo mitieneke mme ñkani edu ukpono Abasi mme ete ete ñnyin-e? Koro mmọ ediade ñkpọ ke mmọ mibemke iso iyet ubọk.”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete, “Mbufo mbon mbubuk, oku Abasi Aisaya ama enen ke ini enye akasiakde Uduak Abasi abaña mbufo mme mbubik,” kpa nte ekewetde ete, “Mbon emi ekpono mi ke ñkpọkinua mmọ, edi esit mmọ ada nsan nsan ọkpọñ Mi. <verse eid="MRK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Mmọ ekpono mi ke ikpuikpu, koro ukpepñkpọ emi mmọ ekpepde edi mme item owo. <verse eid="MRK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Koro mbufo etrede ndinim ata mbet Abasi, edi emum ido ukpono mbufo ekama.” <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Mbufo emenyene ediye usuñ emi esinde mbet Abasi, enyuñ edighi mmọ ke ikpat oto ke ntak edu ukpono Abasi mbufo.<verse eid="MRK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Nte uwutñkpọ, Moses ama owuk mbufo ete, “kpono usọ ye uka,” ndien owo ekededi emi etiñde idiọk ikọ adian ete mme eka esie, enye enyene ndikpa. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Edi mbufo edọhọ ete ke otim ọfọn owo nditre ndise ñkpọ mbaña ete ye eka esie emi minyeneke ñkpọ, ñnyuñ ndọhọ enye nte, “Mbọm, ñkemeke ndiñwam fi, koro mmemen se ñkpọnọde fi nnọ Abasi. <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Ntem ke mbufo ebiat ibet Abasi oto ke mme ido eset emi mbufo enamde ọsọñọ ada. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Emenyuñ enam mme ediwak ñkpọ efen emi etiede ntem.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ntem ke Jisọs ọkọtọñọ ntak okot otu owo ete edi onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “kpukpru mbufo ekpañ utọñ, enyuñ etim efiọk se ñyomde nditiñ emi. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Baba ñkpọ kiet emi otodeto oduk owo idem ikemeke ndisabade owo, edi akam edi se itode owo ke idem iwọrọ asabade owo. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ekpañ ndien utọñ edieke enyenede utọñ ndikop.”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ntem ke Enye ama akadaha okoduk ufọk man ọkpọñ otu owo, ndien mme mbet Esie ema ekebup Enye se ikọ emi Enye eketiñde ọwọrọde.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Enye ama obup mmọ ete, “Nte mbufo nde idiọñọke? Nte mbufo ikemeke ndikut ite ke se mbufo ediade ikemeke ndisabade ukpọñ mbufo. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Koro udia ikemeke ndituk esit mbufo, edi enye asaña ebe ke nsia ye akpa ke idibi mbufo.” (Ke editiñ ntem, Enye ama ọdọhọ ete ke kpukpru udia esana).<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Ndien Enye afiak adian do ete, “Edi se iwọrọde owo ke idem esabarede owo. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Koro mme ndiọi ekikere emi edide idiọk udọñ, inọ, uwot owo, use eto ke esit owo ewọñọ edi. <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Ediyom ñkpọ emi enyenede mbon efen ye oburobut ido, ye abiaña ye obukpo ido ye efibe ye iseri ye ntañidem ye mme ndisime ido efen. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Kpukpru mme ndiọi ñkpọ emi eto owo ke idem ewọñọ; mmọ edi se isabarede mbufo enyuñ enam mbufo ekudot ndidi eke Abasi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Ntem ke Enye ọkọkpọñ Kalili onyuñ adaha aka ke ñkanñkuk Taya ye Sidọn, ndien Enye ama oduk ke esit ufọk onyuñ añwana ndinam edidu Esie do edi ndibe, edi ikekemeke.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Kpa idaha oro ñwan emi ekpri eyen añwan esie emi ndedehe spirit okomumde ama ebine Jisọs. Koro enye ama okop abaña Jisọs ndien ke ntem, enye ama ediduọ Enye ke ukot. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ñwan oro okoto Gris ke Sirofonisia, ndien enye ama ekpe Jisọs ubọk ete yak Enye edibin ndedehe spirit oro osio eyen imọ añwan ke idem.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ enye ete, “Ke akpa ifet Ami ñnyene ndiñwam mbon ubon mme Ju. Ifọnke ndimen udia nditọ ntop nnọ mme ebua.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Enye ama ọbọrọ ete, “Oro edi ata akpanikọ ete, edi kpa idem nditọ ebua emi edude ke idak okpokoro ekeme ndinọ mmọ ndusuk mbeñe udia emi otode usan nditọ.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ enye ete, “Afo omotim ọbọrọ ọfọn eti, ntem amanam mi nnam idem eyen fo ọsọñ; nyọñ ufọk, koro ndedehe spirit oro ọmọkpọñ enye.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ndien ke ini enye ekesimde ufọk, ekpri eyen añwan esie do ana suñ-ñ ke ñkpana esie ndien ndedehe spirit ama ọwọrọ ọkpọñ enye.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Ke ọkpọñde Taya, Enye ama adaha aka Sidọn ndien afiak ọsuhọde ọnyọñ inyañ Kalili ke usuñ mme ikpọ obio duop eken. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Ema eda inan emi mikekemeke nditiñ ikọ ọfọn esọk Enye, ndien kpukpru owo ema ekpe Jisọs ubọk ete yak Enye odori enye ubọk ke idem onyuñ ọkọk enye udọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Jisọs ama ada enye adaha ọkpọñ otu owo ndien esin enye nnuen ubọk Esie ke utọñ, onyuñ afiari etap, (ndien ada etap oro) otuk edeme owo oro. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ntem ke Enye ekemenerede enyin ese enyọñ ndien ye ndodobi nsiama, Enye ama ọdọhọ ete “sirerede”. <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Idaha oro owo oro ama ekeme ndikop ñnyuñ ntiñ ikọ nte ọfọnde.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Jisọs ama oduri otu owo utọñ ete mmọ ekuyak mbuk emi asuana, edi nte Enye okosuk akpakpan mmọ, ntre ke mbuk oro eketetim asuana. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Kpukpru mmọ emi ekekopde se iketibede ye Enye ema edu ke ọyọhọ ñkpaidem. Mmọ ema edọhọ ete se nte Enye akanamde kpukpru ñkpọ ọfọñ. Enye anam idem inan okop ikọ, imum onyuñ etiñ ikọ.<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Usen kiet, nte otu owo efen ekebohode, mmọ ikenyeneke se ediade, Jisọs ama okot mbet Esie, onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Mmokop mbọm eti eti mbaña otu owo emi, koro mmọ edu ye ami usen ita, ndien idiaha baba ñkpọ ndomokiet. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ndien edieke ndọhọde nte yak mmọ enyọñọ, ke mmennọhọ mmọ ñkpọ edia; isiọñ ọbiọñ eyenam mmọ esuhọ ke usuñ. Koro, ndusuk mmọ eto ata anyan ebiet.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Mbet Esie ema ebup Enye ete, “Mmọñ mi ke isọñ utatan ke idikut udia emi edikemde ndinọ ofuri otu emi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Enye ama obup mmọ ete, “Mbufo enyene ebok uyo ifañ?” Mmọ ema ebọrọ ete, “Itiaba”. <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Ntre Enye ama ọdọhọ otu owo ete esuhọde etetie ke isọñ. Ntem ke Enye ekemen ebok uyo itiaba emi, ọkọm Abasi abaña mmọ. Obuñ mmọ ñkeñe ñkeñe onyuñ ayak mmọ ọnọ mbet Esie. Ndien mbet esie emen mmọ edeme enọ mme otu owo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ema enyene ñkpri iyak ifañ, ntre ñko Jisọs ama ọnọ Abasi ekọm abaña mmọ emi, onyuñ ọdọhọ mbet Esie ete yak emen edeme enọ mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Kpukpru owo ema edia enyuñ eyuhọ. Ndien ke oro ebede ema etañ mbeñe uyo emi ọkọyọhọde ọsuhọ ọyọhọ akpasa duopeba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ñkpọ nte tọsin owo inañ ekedu ke itie udia oro, ndien Jisọs ama anam mmọ enyọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Idaha oro, ke emi ama ekekure, Enye ama oduk ubom ye mbet Esie enyuñ ebe eka ke ñkanñkuk Dalmanuta. <verse eid="MRK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mbon ñka mme Farisi ema editọñọ ndibup Jisọs mbume. Mmọ ekeyom ndidomo enye, do mmọ ema eyom eto Enye idiọñọ emi otode enyọñ.<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Enye ama asiama ko-o ke esit Esie onyuñ obup ete, “Ntaha emana emi eyomde utibe idiọñọ-ọ? Ntiñ akpanikọ nnọ mbufo nte idinọhọ enye baba idiọñọ kiet.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ntre ke Enye akafiak okoduk ubom onyuñ adaha ọkpọñ mmọ ndien ewat ebe inyañ ekebehe ke mben ñkpọdiọhọ mmọñ eken. <verse eid="MRK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Edi mbet Esie ema efre ndida uyo efen ñkama ye mmọ mbemiso mmọ ekpọñ isọñ ndien mmọ ekenyene ebok uyo kiet kpọt ke ubom.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Jisọs ama oduri mmọ utọñ ete, “Ekpeme eti eti kabaña ibọk ndom uyo mbon ñka Farisi ye eke Erọd.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Mmọ ema eneme ye kiet eken ete, “Enye etiñ ikọ emi sia ñnyin minyeneke uyo ndomokiet.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jisọs ama ọdiọñọ abaña se mmọ ekenemede, ndien Enye ama obup mmọ ete, “Ntaha etiñde ebaña unana edinyene uyo-o? Nte mbufo ikemeke ndidioño? Nte esit mbufo ñko ọsọñ akaha ndidiọñọ? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mbufo emenyene enyin, edi etre ndida ñkut usuñ, enyuñ enyene utọñ, edi esin ndikop ikọ, mme nte mbufo ikemeke nditi baba ñkpọ ndomokiet?”<verse eid="MRK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ke ini ñkọbọkde tọsin owo ition ye ebok uyo ition, akpasa mbeñe uyo ifañ ke mbufo eketañ ke ema ekedia udia ema? Mmọ ema ebọrọ ete, “Duopeba”.<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Ndien ke ini ñkebọkde tọsin owo inañ ye ebok uyo itiaba, ñyọhọ nsuhọ esie akawak adaña didie? Mmọ ema ebọrọ ete, “Akpasa itiaba”.<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Enye ama obup mmọ ete, “Nte isuk inwañake mbufo tutu emi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Ke mmọ ema ekesim Betsaida, mme owo emen owo nnan esọk Enye enyuñ ekpe Enye ubọk ete otuk enye onyuñ anam udọñọ esie okure. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jisọs ama omum owo nnan oro ke ubọk onyuñ ada enye ọwọrọ ọkpọñ esit obio, ndien afiari etap eyet enye ke enyin onyuñ otuk enye ubọk ke enyin, ndien obup enye ete, “Afo emekeme ndikut ñkpọ ndomokiet idahaemi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Owo oro ama ese akanade onyuñ ọbọrọ ete “lh. Mokut mme owo, edi mmọ etie nte mme eto esañade ekanade.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Ntem ke Jisọs akafiak odori ubọk ke enyin esie, ndien enye etim owuk enyin esie ese ñkpọ, enyin esie ama atara ọfọn, enye onyuñ okut kpukpru ñkpọ nte ọfọnde.<verse eid="MRK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Jisọs ama ọnọ enye ọnyọñ aka ufọk mmọ, onyuñ ọdọhọ enye ete, “Kufiak unyọñ uka ke obio.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Jisọs ye mbet Esie ema ekpọñ Kalili edaha eka ke mme obio emi ekedude ke Siseria Filipai. Nte mmọ ekesañade ke usuñ, Enye ama obup mmọ ete, “Mme owo edọhọ ete ke Ami ndi anie?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Mbet Esie ema ebọrọ Enye ete, ndusuk mmọ edọhọ ete Afo edi Jọn enim owo babtisim. Ndien mbio efen edọhọ ete ke Afo edi Elaiya, ndusuk ete kiet ke otu mme Asiak Uduak Abasi.<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Ndien Enye obup mmọ ete, “mbufo edọhọ ete Ami ndi Anie?” Pita ama ọbọrọ Enye ete, “Afo edi Kraist Andinyaña.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Edi Jisọs ama akpan mmọ ete ekutiñ enọ baba owo kiet ebaña Imọ.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ntem ke Enye ọkọtọñọ nditiñ nnọ mmọ, nte ke Eyen Owo enyene ndibọ ediwak nsio nsio ufen. Ndien ke mme ikpọ owo ufọk Abasi ye mme ikpọ oku Abasi ye mme ada ibuot ñka ukpono mme Ju eyesin Enye enyuñ ewot Enye, ndien ke Enye eyeset ke ñkpa ke ọyọhọ usen ita. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Enye ama etim etiñ ikọ emi añwa añwa, do Pita ama ada Enye ọwọñọde ada onyuñ ọtọñọ ndisua nnọ Enye.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Jisọs ama ọwọñọde enyin ese mbet Esie, onyuñ ọdọhọ Pita ke ata ọkpọsọñ uyo ete, “Setan da ke edem Mi. Afo ekere nte owo ekerede, edi idighe nte Abasi ekerede.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ntem ke Enye okokot mbet Esie ye ofuri otu owo esaña ekpere, enyuñ ekpañ utọñ. “Edieke owo mbufo kiet ekededi oyomde ndidi mbet Mi, enye enyene ndikpọnọde kpukpru inemesit esie nnim ñkañ kiet ndien emen krọs esie odori ke afara onyuñ etiene Mi. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Edieke owo ndomokiet akade iso oyom uwem esie, ọyọduọk enye; edi owo eke ọduọkde uwem esie ke ntak Mi ye ke ntak Eti Mbuk eyenyaña uwem esie.<verse eid="MRK 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ndien nso udori ke owo edibọ edieke enye adiade ofuri ererimbot ndien ọduọk uwem esie ke oruk usuñ oro? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Mme, nso ke owo edinọ ke ndida ñkpuhọ ukpọñ esie? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ndien owo ekededi emi okopde but abaña Mi ye etop Mi ke mme usen emi ọyọhọde ye unana edinim ke akpanikọ ye idiọk ñkpọ, Ami, Andinyaña, ñyenyuñ ñkop but mbaña enye ke ini ndifiakde ndi kubọñ Ete Mi ye mme ndisana enjel.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Jisọs ama osuk aka iso ọdọhọ mbet Esie ete, “Ndusuk mbufo emi ededa mi idahaemi eyedu uwem ekut nte Obio Ubọñ Abasi edidide ye ọyọhọ odudu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ke usen itiokiet ema ekebe Jisọs ama ada Pita, Jems ye Jọn ọdọk aka enyọñ ñkoñkoñ obot, ebiet emi mmọ ekedude ikpọñ. Do, Enye ama ọkpuhọrede mbiet Esie ke iso mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Ndien ọfọñidem Esie esem onyuñ afia eti eti onyuñ eye akan nte ubọk owo ndomokiet ke isọñ ekpeyetde. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ntem ke Elaiya ye Moses ekebiọñọrede enyuñ etọñọ nditiñ ikọ ye Jisọs.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pita ama ọdọhọ Jisọs ete, Andikpep, “Ọfọn ñnyin ndidu mi. Ñnyin iyebọp atayat ita mi, kiet enyene Fi, kiet enyene Moses, kiet onyuñ enyene Elaiya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Enye ikọfiọkke se ekpetiñde koro ndik ama anam mmọ ata eti eti. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Edi ke adañaemi enye osuk akade iso etiñ mme ikọ emi, obubit enyọñ ama ofuk mmọ, ndien uyo oto ke obubit ikpa enyọñ etiñ ọdọhọ ete, “Emi edi edima Eyen Mi. Ekpañ utọñ enọ Enye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ndien idaha oro mmọ ema ese ekanade, edi ikekwe baba owo ndomokiet ibọhọke Jisọs ikpọñ ọkọsuhọ ye mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Nte mmọ ekesuhọrede ke obot, Jisọs ama oduri mmọ utọñ ete ekutiñ se mmọ ekekutde enọ owo ndomokiet tutu ekem ini emi Eyen owo edisetde ke ñkpa. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ntre ke mmọ ekemum Enye ekama — ke esit mmọ, edi ema eneme ke otu mmọ ebaña se ediset ke ñkpa emi Enye eketiñde abaña ọwọrọde.<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Mmọ ema ebup Enye ete, “Ntaha mme andikpep ibet edọhọde ete ke Elaiya enyene ndibem iso ndi, mbemiso Andinyaña edi-e?” <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete. “Elaiya enyene ndibem iso ndi ke akpanikọ, ñnyuñ nditim kpukpru ñkpọ nnim. Edi nsidi ntak emi ewetde ete ke Eyen Owo enyene ndibọ ndodobi ufen, mme owo enyuñ esin Enye-e? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Edi ntiñ nnọ mbufo nte ke Elaiya ededi, ndien mme owo ema enam ye enye kpukpru se mmọ ekemade, asaña ekekem nte Ñwed Abasi eketiñde abaña Enye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ke mmọ ema ekedisim mme mbet eken, mmọ ema ekut akamba otu owo ekanarede mbet usukkiet eken ekuk ye nte ndusuk mme andikpep ibet enenide eneni ye mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Otu owo ese Jisọs ke ñkpaidem ke ini Enye akasañade ekpere mmọ ndien ntem ke mmọ ekefeñe ekekọm Enye. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Mbufo eneni eneni ye mmọ ebaña nso?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Owo kiet ke otu oro ama ọbọrọ ete, “Andikpep, ñkada eyen mi eren ndi emi ndedehe spirit omumde, anam enye ikemeke nditiñ ikọ. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mma mbeñe mme mbet Fo nte ebin enye ndedehe spirit oro esio, edi mmọ ikekemeke.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mbet Esie ete, “O! Emana unana mbuọtidem, adaña didie ke ndifiak ndu ye mbufo, ndien mbufo enim Mi ke akpanikọ! Adaña didie ke ndinyene ime ye mbufo! Emen ekpri eyen eren oro esọk Mi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ntre mmọ ema eda eyen oro esọk Jisọs, ndien ke adañaemi enye okokutde Jisọs, ndedehe spirit oro ama atuak eyen oro ke idem ata ọkpọsọñ ọkpọsọñ, ndien enye ama ọduọ ke isọñ amiañare onyuñ ọkọk efot ke inua.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jisọs ama obup ete eyen oro ete, “Ebighi adaña didie tọñọ ñkpọ emi ọkọtọñọ ndinam enye ntem?” Ndien enye ama ọbọrọ ete, “tọñọ ke ini emi enye ekedide ata ekpri eyen. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kpukpru ini ndedehe spirit emi esinam enye ọduọ oduk ikañ mme mmọñ man owot enye. Tua ñnyin mbọm nyuñ nam ñkpọ ndiñwam ñnyin edieke Afo ekemede.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ ete, “Edieke ekemede? Ñkpọ kiet ekededi ekeme nditibe nnọ owo ekededi emi enyenede mbuọtidem.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ete esie idaha oro ama ọbọrọ ete, “Ami mmenyene mbuọtidem, O ñwam mi man ñnyene mbuọtidem emi okponde akan emi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Ke ini Jisọs okokutde nte otu owo ekade iso nditọt, Enye ama asua ọnọ ndedehe spirit oro, onyuñ ọdọhọ ete, “Afo spirit imum ye inan, mmowuk fi nte wọrọ kpọñ eyen emi, ndien kuduk enye idem aba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ntem ke idiọk spirit oro akaduari ata ọkpọsọñ onyuñ osio enye ọduọk ndien ọwọrọ ọkpọñ enye, ndien eyen oro ana do suñ-ñ inyuñ isioroke uyo, ke enyin kpukpru owo eketie nte enye akpa, kpa nte mmọ eketiñde. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Edi Jisọs ama omum enye ke ubọk onyuñ añwam enye ndineñede nda ke ikpat esie mbiba, enye ama eneñede ada. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ke Jisọs ama okoduk esit ufọk, mme mbet Esie ema ebup Enye ete “Nsidi ntak emi ñnyin mikekemeke ndibin ndedehe spirit oro nsio?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ ete, mme utọ ñkpọ ntem oyom akam ye utreudia.<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Mmọ ema ekpọñ ñkañ oro, enyuñ esaña ebe ke Kalili. Jisọs ikeyomke owo ndomokiet ọfiọk ebiet emi mmọ ekedude. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Koro Enye ekekpepde mbet Esie ete, “Eyesana Eyen Owo eyak esin mme owo ke ubọk, mmọ eyewot Enye, ndien ke ọyọhọ usen ita, Enye eyeset ke ñkpa onyuñ odu uwem.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ikọ oro ikeñwañake mmọ, edi mmọ ema ekop ndik ndibup Enye se ikọ Esie ọwọrọde.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Mmọ ema edisim Kapanọm. Ke ini Enye okodude ke esit ufọk, Enye ama obup mmọ ete, “Nso ke mbufo ekeneni ke usuñ ebabaña?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Edi but ama anam mmọ ndibọrọ Enye, koro mmọ ekenenide ebaña Enye emi okponde akan ke otu mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Enye ama ọsuhọde etetie ndien okot mmọ esaña ekpere, onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Enye emi oyomde ndidi andikpon ñkan enyene ndidi andikpri ñkan, asañutom kpukpru owo.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ntem ke Enye okosio ekpri eyenọwọñ enim ke ufọt mmọ, ndien Enye omum eyen oro ke ubọk akama, onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Owo ekededi emi edidarade ekpri eyenọwọñ ntem ke enyiñ Mi adara Mi, ndien owo eke adarade Mi adara Ete Mi emi ọkọdọñde Mi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Kiet ke otu mbet Esie, Jọn, ama ọdọhọ Enye usen kiet ete, “Andikpep ñnyin ima ikut nte owo adade enyiñ Fo ebin mme ndedehe spirit edi ñnyin ima idọhọ enye ite okunam, koro enye midighe kiet ke otu ñka ñnyin.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ekukpan enye, koro iduhọ baba owo kiet emi anamde mme utibe ñkpọ ke enyiñ Mi, emi ekemede ndisọp ntiñ idiọk ikọ ndian Mi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Koro owo emi mibiọñọke ñnyin ada ye ñnyin. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Koro owo ekededi emi edinọde mbufo kọb mmọñ kiet eñwọñ koro mbufo edide eke Kraist iditreke ndibọ utib. Ntiñ emi ke ata ofuri akpanikọ nte ke enye iditreke ndibọ utib esie.” <verse eid="MRK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Edi, edieke owo edinamde kiet ke otu ñkpri nditọ emi, emi ebuọtde idem ye Ami eduọk mbuọtidem, ọkpọfọn ye enye akan edieke ekpedade akwa itiat ukọkñkpọ ebọp eyiri enye ke itọñ enyuñ etop enye esin ke inyañ.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Edieke ubọk fo anamde fi anam idiọkñkpọ, sibe enye fep; ọfọn afo ndiduk ke uwem ye ndo akan afo ndinyene ubọk ke itie ikañ ndutuhọ, ebiet emi ikañ minyeneke ndinime. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Do, mme utuñ mmọ inyeneke edikpaña, ikañ inyuñ inimeke. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Onyuñ edieke edide ukot fo esin fi anam idiọkñkpọ, sibe enye fep, ọfọn afo ndidi mbuñọ nduk ke uwem akan ndinyene ukot mbiba ndien eduọk fi ke itie ndutuhọ. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Do, mme utuñ mmọ idikpañake, owo idinyuñ inimeke ikañ.<verse eid="MRK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />“Onyuñ edieke enyin fo esinde fi anam idiọk, wubede enye duọk. Ọfọn afo ndiduk ke Obio Ubọñ Abasi ye enyin kiet akan ndinyene enyin mbiba ndien etop fi eduọk ke itie ndutuhọ (hell), <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />ebiet emi utuñ mikemeke ndikpa ndien ikañ ikemeke ndinime. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ebiet emi edidade ikañ enam ñnyin isana kpa nte edade inuñ enam unam uwa asana.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Inuñ edi eti ñkpọ, edi edieke enye ọduọkde inem esie, edikeme didie nditọñọ ntak nnam enye enyene inem? Enyene inuñ ke otu mbufo, enyuñ edu ke emem ye kiet eken.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ekem Jisọs ọkpọñ Kapanọm onyuñ asaña oduk aka ñkañ usuk usuk ke adaña Judia ye ñkanñkuk edem edere akpa Jọdan. Ndien kpa nte esidide, kpukpru ini, otu owo ema edi ebine Enye, ñko kpa nte Enye esinamde, Enye ama ekpep mmọ ñkpọ.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ndusuk mme mbon ñka mme Farisi ema edi ke idomo edibup Enye ete, “Nte enen owo ndisio ñwan esie ndo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Nso ke Moses eketiñ abaña usio ndọ?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Mmọ ema ebọrọ ete, “Moses ama enyime owo ndiwet ñwed usio ndọ, ñnyuñ nsio ñwan ndọ.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Okoto ke ntak ọkpọsọñ isọñesit mbufo akanam Moses ewet ibet oro. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Edi toto ke editọñọ, ke ini emi Abasi okobotde ñkpọ, Enye ama obot mmọ eren ye ñwan. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Anam ke ntak emi, eren owo eyekpọñ ete ye eka esie, onyuñ akadiana ye ñwan esie. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Ndien mmọ mbiba eyekabade edi obuk kiet, idighe aba owo iba, edi akabade edi kiet kpọt. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ndien baba owo ndomokiet okudiañade se Abasi ama akadian.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ke ini esisit ama ekebe, ke ini mmọ ekedude ke ufọk, mme mbet Esie ema efiak ebup Enye ebaña ñkpọ emi.<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Enye ama ọbọrọ ete, “Owo ekededi emi osiode ñwan esie ndọ, onyuñ ọkọdọ ñwan efen, enye esin efibe ye enye. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ndien edieke ñwan osiode ebe esie ndọ ndien afiak ọkọdọ eren owo efen, enye ñko esin efibe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Mme owo ema eda nditọ ọwọñ esọk Jisọs man Enye ọdiọñ mmọ, edi mbet Esie ema ebin mmọ enyọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Edi ke adañaemi Jisọs okokutde se ikakade iso, Enye ama ayat esit ye mbet Esie, onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Eyak ñkpri nditọ etiene Mi, ekukpan mmọ, koro Obio Ubọñ Abasi enyene oruk owo nte mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ke ofuri akpanikọ ke ndọhọ mbufo, nte owo ekededi emi esinde ndibọ Obio Ubọñ Abasi nte ekpri eyen, ididukke ke esit.”<verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ndien Enye okot ñkpri nditọ adian ke idem Esie, odori mmọ kiet kiet ubọk ke ibuot onyuñ ọdiọñ mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Nte Jisọs ọkọtọñọde isañ Esie, owo kiet ama efehe ebine Enye, onyuñ ọkọduọ ọtọñọ edọñ ke iso Esie ndien obup Enye ete, “Eti Andikpep, nso ke ndinam man ñnyene nsinsi uwem?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jisọs ama obup enye, “Nso idi ntak emi afo okotde Mi eti? ‘Baba owo ndomokiet ifọnke ke ebede Abasi ikpọñ ikpọñ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Edi ọmọfiọk mme mbet emi, kuwot owo, kusin efibe, kuyip inọ, kusu nsu, kutuk owo, kpono Usọ ye uka.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Owo oro ama ọbọrọ ete, “Mma nnenim kpukpru emi toto ke uyen mi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Jisọs ama owuk enyin ese enye onyuñ enyene ima abaña enye, ndien ọdọhọ enye ete, “ñkpọ kiet anana fi. Ka kanyam kpukpru inyene fo nyuñ nọ mme ubuene okuk oro ndien afo eyenyene inyene ke Obio Ubọñ Abasi ndien di disaña ye Ami.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ntem iso ama ọtuhọ owo emi, ndien enye adaha ọnyọñ ye mfuhọ koro enye edi owo emi ekenyenede ata ediwak inyene.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jisọs ama ese akanade, onyuñ ọdọhọ mbet Esie ete, “Edisọñ adaña didie owo inyene ndiduk Obio Ubọñ Abasi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Ikọ emi ama akpa mmọ idem eti eti. Ntre ke Jisọs akafiak ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “ndima nditọ, ọsọñ adaña didie ọnọ mmọ emi ebuọtde idem ke inyene ndiduk ke Obio Ubọñ Abasi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Edi mmem mmem ñkpọ ọnọ enañ ndisaña mbe ke odudu abiabon akan owo inyene ndiduk ke Obio Ubọñ Abasi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Idem ama etetim akpa mme mbet, mmọ enyuñ ebup kiet eken ete, “Anie ndien ke edinyaña?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jisọs ama owuk enyin ese mmọ suñ-ñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ye owo, emi edi ata ọkpọsọñ ñkpọ, edi idighe ntre ye Abasi. Ye Abasi, kpukpru ñkpọ edi mmem mmem.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Ntem ke Pita ọkọtọñọ ndisiak kpukpru se enye ye mbet eken ekedahade ekpọñ. Pita ama ọdọhọ Enye ete, “Sese ñnyin ima ikpọñ kpukpru ñkpọ man itiene Fi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Ndien Jisọs ama ọbọrọ enye ete, “Yak Mi nnam fi ọfiọk ete baba owo kiet ekededi emi ọkpọñde ñkpọ ekededi emi enye enyenede, ufọk ye nditọ eka iren, ye nditọ eka iban, ye eka ye ete, ye nditọ ọwọñ mme inyene, ke ntak ima eke enye amade Mi, ye Eti Mbuk, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />iditreke ndibọ utib ikikie awak akan, kpa ke eyo emi, mme ufọk, nditọ ete iren ye eke iban, mme eka, nditọ ye mme isọñ, ndien ukọbọ eyediana do, ndien ke eyo emi edidide enye eyenyene nsinsi uwem. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ediwak mmọ emi edide akpa idahaemi, eyedi akpatre, ndien mme akpatre eyedi akpa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Mmọ ekedu ke usuñ uka Jerusalem, Jisọs ekebe iso ọnọ mmọ. Mme mbet ema edu ke ñkpaidem, ke ini mmọ emi eketienede ke edem ekeyọhọde ye ndik. Jisọs ama ọtọñọ ntak ada mbet Esie duopeba ọwọñọde ada, onyuñ emen kpukpru se iditibede inọ Enye ke Jerusalem etiñ ọnọ mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Enye ama ọdọhọ ete, “Ñnyin imọñ idọk ika Jerusalem, ndien, eyetap Eyen owo enọ mme ikpọ oku ye mme ekpep ibet. Mmọ eyebiere ikpe ñkpa enọ Enye, eyenyuñ esana Enye eyak enọ mbon emi midighe mme Ju.” <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Mmọ eyesak Enye, enyuñ ekọk Enye etap enyuñ emia Enye, enyuñ ewot Enye, edi ke ọyọhọ usen ita ama ebe, “Enye eyeset afiak odu uwem.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Ntem ke Jems ye Jọn nditọ Sebidi, ekebine Jisọs enyuñ ekedọhọ enye ete, “Andikpep, ñnyin iyom Fi anam eti ñkpọ ọnọ ñnyin.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Nso ke eyom Mi nnam nnọ mbufo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Mmọ ema ebọrọ Enye ete, “Ke ini editiede ke ebekpo Fo, ke utibe Obio Ubọñ, nam ñnyin itie, owo kiet ke ubọk nnasia Fo ye kiet eken ke ubọk ufien.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Edi Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Mbufo ifiọkke se ebeñede! Nte mbufo emekeme ndiñwọñ utọ ndotndot ọkọb mfuhọ emi Ami ndiñwọñde? Mme ndina utọ babtisim ufen emi ami ñyomde ndina?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Mmọ ema ebọro ete, “Ih, ñnyin imekeme!” Ndien Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Mbufo ke akpanikọ eyeñwọñ ke kọb emi eke ndiñwọñde enyuñ ena babtisim emi Ami nnade. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Edi Ami ñnyeneke unen ndimek mmọ emi editiede Mi ke ufien ye nnasia. Itie oro ana ọnọ mmọ emi ema ekememek enim.” <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ke ini mbet eken ekekopde ebaña se Jems ye Jọn ekebupde Jisọs, mmọ ema eyat esit ye mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Ntre ke Jisọs okokot mmọ onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Nte mbufo ediọñọde, mme ndidem ye mme andikara ke isọñ ekara mmọ emi edude ke idak mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Edi ke otu mbufo, idighe ntre. Owo ekededi emi oyomde ndikara ke otu mbufo enyene ndidi asañautom mbufo. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Ndien owo ekededi emi oyomde ndikpon ñkan kpukpru owo, enyene ndikabade ndi ofin kpukpru owo. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Koro Eyen Owo ke idem Esie ikedighe man enam ñkpọ enọ Enye, edi man anam ñkpọ ọnọ mmọ efen, ọnọ uwem Esie ndifak kpukpru owo.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Mmọ ema ekesim Jeriko, ke esisit ini ama ekebe, nte mmọ ekekpọñde obio oro, akwa otu owo ema etiene Enye. Owo nnan kiet emi ekekerede Batimọs, eyen Timiọs eketie ke mben usuñ ebeñe ebeñe.<verse eid="MRK 10:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ke ini Batimọs okokopde ete ke Jisọs emi otode Nasaret edi oro, enye ama ọtọñọ ndifiori, “Jisọs eyen Defid, tua mi mbọm.”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Ndusuk mme owo ema eduat enye ete, “Kibi inua fo”. Edi enye ama osuk aka iso ndifiori ọsọñ akan akpa ke ọkpọsọñ uyo, kubọk kubọk, “Afo eyen Defid tua mi mbọm!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Ke ini Jisọs okokopde mfiori esie, Enye ama atuak ada do ke usuñ onyuñ ọdọhọ ete, “Ekot enye edi mi.” Ntem ke mmọ ekekot owo nnan oro, ete, “Afo dahada di, Enye kokot fi,” <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Batimọs ama otop ọfọñidem esie enim, obumede adahada ke ukot esie onyuñ ebine Jisọs.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jisọs ama obup enye ete, “Afo oyom Mi nam nso nnọ fi?” Owo nnan oro ama ọbọrọ ete, “Andikpep ñyom ndikut usuñ!” <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Ndien Jisọs ama ọdọhọ enye ete, “ọfọn yak osu ọnọ fi, mbuọtidem fo amanyaña fi.” Ndien ke ndo ndo oro, owo nnan oro ama okut usuñ, ndien enye ama etiene Jisọs.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Nte mmọ ekesañade ekpere Jerusalem, mmọ ema edisim Betfek ye Betani ke obot Ọlif, Jisọs ama ọdọñ mbet Esie iba ebem mmọ iso eka,<verse eid="MRK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Eka ndien ema enyuñ ededuk do, mbufo eyekut abak ayara enañ emi akananam owo midoroke ke enye, etat enye eda esọk Mi. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Ndien edieke owo kiet ekededi edibupde mbufo ntak mbufo enamde ntre, ekam edọhọ ete, Ete ufọk ñnyin oyom enye, ndien enye eyenọ efiak eda ediyak idahaemi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Mmọ ema eka enyuñ ekekut abak ayara enañ mbiomo ke efak nte eyiride ekpere mben enyin usuñ ufọk, ndien nte mmọ ekeñwanade nditat, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />ndusuk mme owo emi ekedade ekpere ema ebup mmọ ete, “Nsidi ntak emi mbufo etatde enañ oro?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Mmọ ema etiñ ukem ukem nte Jisọs ọkọdọhọde mmọ ete ekpetiñ, do ndien ke mme owo oro ekenyime mmọ etat.<verse eid="MRK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Ntre ema eda enañ oro esọk Jisọs ndien mme mbet Esie ema ebri ọfọñidem mmọ ke edem enañ oro, ndien Jisọs ama ọdọk etie ke edem Esie. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ntem ke ediwak owo ekebri ọfọñidem mmọ ke ọkpọusuñ, ke adañaemi ndusuk mmọ eken ekesuande mme ñkọk eto emi ekesibede ke ikọt.<verse eid="MRK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Mmọ emi ekebede iso ye mmọ emi ekekperede edem ema efiori ete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Itoro!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Itoro enyene Enye mi edide ke Enyiñ Ọbọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Itoro enyene Obio Ubọñ emi edidide, kpa Obio Ubọñ Ete ñnyin Defid!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">“Itoro ke ata ikpa enyọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Ndien ntre ke Enye ama okoduk Jerusalem onyuñ ebe oduk ke itie ukpono Abasi, Enye ama emenerede enyin ese akanade, ese kpukpru ñkpọ ndien Enye ọkpọñ do koro ini ama ababiara, ndien Enye ama ọwọrọ aka Betani ye mbet Esie duopeba.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ke ndañ nsiere, nte mmọ ekpọñde Betani, biọñ ama ọdọñ Jisọs. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ke ñkpọ nte ikpat ifañ ke iso, Enye ama ada okut udari (eto fik) ye ediwak ikọñ ke idem esie, ntre Enye ama asaña ekpere man ese mme eyekut mfri esie. Edi ikeduhọ ibọhọke ikọñ ikpọñ koro ikedighe ini emi enye esinwumde mfri.<verse eid="MRK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Ntem ke Jisọs ọkọdọhọ eto oro ete, “Afo udunwumke aba mfri ke nsinsi.” Ndien mbet esie ema ekop se Enye eketiñde.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Ke ini mmọ ema ekesim Jerusalem Enye ama oduk aka itie ukpono Abasi onyuñ ekebin mme anyam urua ye mme andidedep ndien onuk okpokoro mme ọkpuhọ okuk ọduọk ye ñkpọ itie mme anyam ibiom. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Onyuñ akpan kpukpru owo ndibiom ñkpọ nsaña mbe ke itie ukpono Abasi.<verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ema ewet ke ñwed ikọ Abasi ete, Ufọk Mi eyedi ufọk akam ọnọ ofuri ekondo, edi mbufo emenam enye akabade edi ufọk mbon ñwo.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ke ini mme ikpọ oku ye mme ada ibuot ukpono mme Ju ekekopde se Enye akanamde mmọ ema etọñọ ndidiomi mbaña ata eti usuñ nte edisañade imum Enye iwot. Mmọ ema ekop ndik ebaña Enye, koro mme owo ema edu ke ñkpaidem ebaña ukpepñkpọ Esie.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ke mbubreyo usen oro, Jisọs ye mbet Esie ema ewọñọ ekpọñ obio. <verse eid="MRK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ndien ke ndañ nsiere oro, nte mmọ ekesañade ebe udari emi Enye okosuñide, mmọ ema ekut ete ke enye ama eyemede akpa tutu ye ke oruñ esie. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Ntem ke Pita eketi se Jisọs eketiñde ye eto oro ke usen emi ekebede ndien enye ofiori ete, “Sese, Andikpep! Eto udari emi Afo okosuñide eyemede onyuñ akpa.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete, “Enyene mbuọtidem ke Abasi.” <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />“Ke akpanikọ ke ndọhọ mbufo nte, edieke owo ekededi ọdọhọde obot emi ete, ‘Wuhọde nyuñ koduk inyañ,’ minyuñ iyikke ke esit esie, edi enimde ke akpanikọ ete se imọ itiñde eyetibe, se enye editiñde eyetibe. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ke ntre, Ami ntiñ nnọ mbufo nte, se ededi emi mbufo ebupde ke akam, enim ke akpanikọ nte ke mmimọ imọbọ, ndien mbufo eyebọ. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Edi ke ini mbufo ebọñde akam, ebemiso edahado enọ owo emi mbufo ekenyenede ikọ man Ete mbufo emi odude ke enyọñ ekeme ndifen mme idiọkñkpọ mbufo ñko.<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Edieke mbufo midahakedo inọ mmọ efen, Ete mbufo emi odude ke enyọñ idinyuñ idahakedo inọ mbufo ke mme idiokñkpọ mbufo.” <verse eid="MRK 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Mmọ ema etọñọ ntak ekesim Jerusalem, ndien nte Jisọs akasañade ke itie ukpono Abasi, mme ikpọ oku, mme ekpep ibet ye mme ikpọ owo mme Ju ema esaña ebine Enye, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />enyuñ ebup Enye ete, “Nsutọ unen ke afo enyene ke ndinam mme ñkpọ emi? Anie enọ fi odudu ndinam kpukpru ñkpọ emi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete, “Ñyesian mbufo edieke mbufo edibọrọde Mi mbume kiet. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nte edinim owo babtisim eke Jọn, okoto Abasi mme okoto owo? Ebọrọ Mi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Mmọ ema eneni ke otu mmọ ete, “Edieke ñnyin ibọrọde ite ke Abasi ọkọdọñ enye, ndien Enye eyedọhọ ete, ọfọn, nso idi ntak emi mbufo mikenimke enye ke akpanikọ? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Edi edieke ñnyin idọhọde ite ke idighe Abasi ọkọdọñ enye, k okoto owo,” (mmọ ema ekop ndik ebaña mme owo koro mme owo ekenimde ke ata ofuri akpanikọ ete ke Jọn ekedi Asiak Uduak Abasi).<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Ntre ke mmọ ekebọrọ Jisọs ete, “Ñnyin ikemeke ndibọrọ. Ñnyin ifiọkke.” Ntem ke Jisọs ọkọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ami ñko nditiñke nnọ mbufo odudu emi ndade nnam mme ñkpọ emi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Enye ama ọtọñọ nditiñ ikọ nnọ mme owo ke ñke; “Owo kiet ama ọtọ iñwañ mmin onyuñ ọbọp ọkọ akanade enye okuk ndien otibi obube unyimi mmin onyuñ ọbọp enyọñ ukpeme ọnọ mme ekpeme iñwañ. Ntem ke enye akayak iñwañ oro ọnọ mme ekpeme iñwañ onyuñ adaha aka anyan isañ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Edi ke ini idọk ama ekekem enye ama ọdọñ eyen ufọk esie kiet ete ọkọbọ udeme mfri esie edi. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Edi mme ekpeme iñwañ oro ema emia enye enyuñ enọ enye ọnyọñ ubọk ubọk<verse eid="MRK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Enyene iñwañ ama afiak osio owo efen ke otu mbon utom esie ọdọñ emi okonyuñ osuk ọbọde kpasuk ukem ukem ufen emi akpa owo ọkọbọde, ọdọdiọk akan eke akpa, koro mmọ ema emia enye ibuot, etuhọde enye enyuñ esuene enye. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Mmọ ema ewot ọyọhọ owo ita emi enye okosiode ọdọñ, emia ndusuk, ekenyuñ ewewot ndusuk eken.” <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Owo kiet kpọt ọkọsuhọ ndien ekedi eyen ima esie. Kakpatre enye ama osio enye ọdọñ onyuñ ọdọhọ ete ke akpanikọ mmọ eyenọ enye ọyọhọ ukpono.<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Edi ke ini mme oto iñwañ oro ekekutde nte enye edide, mmọ ema edọhọ ete, ‘Enye emi edida iñwañ emi inyene ke ini ete esie ama akpa. Edi, eyak ñnyin iwot enye ndien iñwañ emi eyenyene ñnyin.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ntre ke mmọ ekemum enye enyuñ ewot enye ndien emen okpo esie esio ke iñwañ mmin etop eduọk.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Nso ndien ke mbufo ekere ete ke enyene iñwañ edinam ke ini enye edikopde se iketibede ye isuñutom esie? Enye eyedi ediwot mmọ kpukpru ndien ayak iñwañ oro ọnọ mbon eñwen.” <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Nte mbufo itighi nte ekesikotde itie ñwed Abasi emi ọdọhọde ete:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">Itiat emi mme andibọp ufọk ekesinde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">akabade edi itiat inuk, ata itiat ukpono ke ufọk.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />“Emi edi se Ọbọñ akanamde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">ndien enye edi ata utibe ñkpọ ndikut.”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Do ndien, ikpọ owo mme Ju ema eyom ndimum Enye ke ntak edida mbuk ọtọ iñwañ nnam uwutñkpọ, koro mmọ ema ediọñọ ete ke Enye eketiñ ikọ oro ye mmimọ, mmọ ekedi ata mme ndiọi ekpeme iñwañ ke mbuk oro. Edi mmọ ema efehe ndik ndituk Enye koro mmọ ekebakde otu owo edisin ntime. Ntre ke mmọ ekekpọñ Enye enyuñ enyọñọ. <verse eid="MRK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Ke amanade esit, mmọ ema esioño mme ada ibuot ukpono Abasi ye mme mbon ñka ukara Erọd edọñ ke ọtọ Esie ete ekenyene nneme ye Enye, man mmọ enam Enye etiñ se edikemede ndida mmum Enye.<verse eid="MRK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Mmọ ema edibup Enye ete, “Andikpep, ñnyin imọfiọk ite ke Afo uteñeke owo enyin ke editiñ akpanikọ. Afo uyakke ikọ inua mme se owo ekerede onuk Fi ọkpọñ usuñ, edi ke ofuri akpanikọ Afo ekpep owo usuñ Abasi. Idahaemi, tiñ nọ ñnyin, mme enen ñnyin ndikpe taksi nnọ Sisa mme inenke?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Edi Jisọs ama okut ñkari mmọ, ndien obup ete, “Ntaha eñwanade ndidomo mi-e? Eda okuk esọk mi nse ise.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ke ini mmọ ema ekeyak okuk enọ Enye, Enye ama obup mmọ ete, “Ndise ye enyiñ anie owo ke emiñ ke okuk emi?” Mmọ ema ebọrọ Enye ete, “Eke Sisa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Ndien Jisọs ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Enọ Sisa se inyenede Sisa, enyuñ enọ Abasi se inyenede Abasi.” Idem ama akpa mmọ eti eti ke ibọrọ Esie.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Ekem mme Sadusi edi ebine Enye, mbon emi edọhọde ete ke ediset ke ñkpa idughe. Mmọ ema edọhọ Enye ete,<verse eid="MRK 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Andikpep, Moses ama ọnọ ñnyin ibet ete ke adaña ini owo akpade ndien inyeneke nditọ, eyen ete esie enyene ndida ebekpa oro ndọ ñnyuñ mbon nditọ ke enyiñ esie. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ini kiet, nditọ ete itiaba ema edu, akpa ke otu mmọ ama ọdọ ñwan, ndien enye ama akpa ibonke nditọ. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ntre ke udiana akada ebekpa oro ọdọ, edi enye ñko ama akpa ibonke nditọ. Kpa ntre ñko ke ekedi ye ọyọhọ eyen ete ita. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Ke otu mmọ mbitiaba, ndomokiet emi okobonde nditọ ikọduhọ; ke ata akpatre, ñwan oro ñko ama akpa.<verse eid="MRK 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Se ñnyin iyomde ndifiọk edi emi! Ke usen ediset ke ñkpa enye edidi ñwan anie? Kemi enye ama ọkọdọ kpukpru mmọ kiet kiet?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete, “Mfina mbufo edi koro mbufo mifiọkke ñwed Abasi mme ndifiọk odudu Abasi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Koro ke ini nditọ ete itiaba ye ñwan edisetde ke ñkpa mmọ ididọhọ aba ndọ. Mmọ editie nte mme isuñutom Abasi (enjel).<verse eid="MRK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ndien ka baña ediset ke ñkpa akananam mbufo ikotke ke ñwed Moses nte ikañ akasakde ke ikọt? Nte Abasi ọkọdọhọde Moses ete, ‘Ami ndi Abasi Ebraham ye Abasi Aisik, ye Abasi Jekọb.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Enye edi Abasi mme odu uwem, idighe eke mme akpaña ñkpa. Mbufo emenam akamba ndudue.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Kiet ke otu mme ekpep ibet emi akadade do ekpere akpañ utọñ ke nneme mmọ, ama ọfiọk ete ke Jisọs ọbọrọ ọfọñ. Ntem ke enye okobup ete, “Ke otu kpukpru ibet ewe okpon akan?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ ete, “Enye emi ọdọhọde ete, ‘Ekop O Isrel, Ọbọñ Abasi ñnyin, edi Abasi kiet kpọt. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Ndien mbufo enyene ndima Enye ke ofuri esit mbufo ye ofuri ukpọñ mbufo ye ke ofuri ekikere ye odudu mbufo.’<verse eid="MRK 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ọyọhọ iba edi, enyene ndima mbon efen nte emade idem mbufo, baba ibet efen eke okponde akan iba emi iduhọ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ekpep ibet oro ama ọbọrọ Enye ete, Ete, Afo emetiñ ata akpanikọ ke emi ọdọhọde ete ke Abasi kiet odu ndien efen iduhọ. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ndien mmọfiọk nte ke otim ọfọn ndima Abasi ke ofuri esit, ñnyuñ ndiọñọ Enye ye ofuri odudu, ndinyuñ mma mbon efen nte amade idem fo, ñkan ediwak ediwak mme nsio nsio uwa ke itie uwa ke ufọk Abasi.<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Kini Jisọs okokutde ifiọk owo emi, Enye ama ọdọhọ enye ete, Afo uyomke usuñ ukpọñ Obio Ubọñ Abasi. Ndien ke oro ama ekebe, baba owo ndomokiet ikedehedei ibup Enye aba mbume efen.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Ekem nte Jisọs okosuk ekpepde mme owo ñkpọ ke ufọk ukpono Abasi, Enye ama obup mmọ mbume emi: “Nsidi ntak emi mme andikpep ibet Moses edọhọde ete ke Andinyaña enyene ndito ubon Edidem Defid? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Koro Defid ke idem esie ama etiñ, ndien ekedi Edisana Spirit eketiñ ebe ke enye, ke ini enye ọkọdọhọde ete, ‘Ọbọñ ama ọdọhọ Ọbọñ mi ete tie ke ubọk nnasia mi tutu nnam mme asua fo edi udoriukot fo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Defid ke idem esie okokot Enye Ọbọñ, didie ndien ke Andinyaña ekpekeme ndidi eyen esie?” Ofuri otu owo emi ekedade ema ekpañ utọñ ekop ye idaraesit. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Emi edi mme ndusuk ñkpọ emi enye ekekpepde mmọ ke ini oro: “Ekpeme idem mbufo ye mme andikpep ido ukpono mme Ju, koro mmọ emade ndisine ikpọ ewura, enyuñ eyomde kpukpru owo etuak ibuot enọ mmọ ke ini mmọ esañade ke mme efak urua. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Mmọ ema nditie ke mme ñkoñkoñ ediye itie ke ufọk ukpono Abasi mme Ju ye ke mme itie emi enamde usọrọ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Edi mmọ enana iso obut, ewo mme ebekpa ke ufọk mmọ ndien efuk oruk owo emi mmọ edide, enyuñ eñwana ndidu uwem nte nti owo ke edibọñ anyan akam ke enyin otu owo ke añwa. Ke ntak emi, ufen mmọ eyekpon eti eti.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Ntem ke enye akadaha aka ke ebiet emi ekebe ubọ enọ akanade ke ufọk ukpono Abasi ndien ọkọsuhọde etetie onyuñ ese mme owo nte mmọ kiet kiet esinde okuk mmọ. Ndusuk mme enyene ñkpọ owo ema edọñ ediwak okuk. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ntem ke ubuene ebekpa kiet ekedi, onyuñ ediyak anini iba esin.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Enye ama okot mbet Esie ete edi, onyuñ ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ke akpanikọ ke ndọhọ mbufo nte, ubuene ebekpa emi ọnọ akan se kpukpru mmọ eken enọde. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Koro mmọ eken enọ eto ke otu ediwak ñyọhọ nsuhọ mmọ, edi enye, kpa ke idem unana esie, ayak kpukpru akpatre okuk emi enye ekenyenede ndida ndu uwem ọnọ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Nte Enye ọkọkpọñde ufọk ukpono Abasi mmọ (temple) usen oro, kiet ke otu mbet Esie ama ọdọhọ Enye ete, “Andikpep, amakam okut nte mme ufọk emi eyede. Sese itiat ibibene mmọ nte ebanade.”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ enye ete, “Omokut mme ikpọ ufọk emi? Baba itiat ndomokiet idisuhọke ke enyọñ itiat efen ibọhọke ndikpọñ enye ke ñwure.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Nte Jisọs eketiede ke Obot Ọlif emi asakde iso ese ufọk ukpono Abasi, Pita, Jems, Jọn ye Andru ema ebup Enye ke ndibe ete, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tiñ nọ ñnyin, ini ewe ke kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi editibe inọ Ufọk ukpono Abasi emi? Nso ididi idiọñọ ndiwut nte ke kpukpru ñkpọ emi emọñ ediwọrọ esu?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ekpeme eti eti, ekuyak owo ada mbufo awaha ọkpọñ usuñ. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Koro ediwak eyedi ke enyiñ Mi, enyuñ ebiaña ediwak owo ete ke mmimọ idi Andinyaña ndien eyeda ediwak ewaha ekpọñ usuñ. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ema ekop ebaña mme ekọñ ye mme etop ekọñ, ekuyomo nsia, koro mme ñkpọ ntre enyene nditibe edi emi iwutke nte ke utit ini edi.<verse eid="MRK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Koro mme idut eyesiak ekọñ enyuñ eñwana ye kiet eken; ndien unyekisọñ ye akañ eyedu ke nsio nsio idut. Kpukpru emi edi ntọñọ ubiak ye ukut emi edidide ke ini iso.” <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Edi ke ini mme ñkpọ emi editọñọde ndisu, etim ekpeme koro mbufo eyedu ke ata akamba afanikọñ. Eyeduri mbufo eka esop, enyuñ emia mbufo ke itie ukpono Abasi ndien eyetiñ mme nsu nsu ikọ edian mbufo ke iso mme andikara ye mme ndidem ke ntak emi edide mbet Mi. Emi edidi akwa ifet inọ mbufo nditiñ Eti Mbuk emi nnọ mmọ. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Koro enyene ndinam ofuri ekondo ekop ebaña Eti Mbuk emi mbemiso akpatre usen edi. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Edi ke ini edimumde mbufo ika ke iso ikpe ekukere ebaña se enyenede nditiñ man enyaña idem mbufo. Edi etiñ se Abasi edidọhọde mbufo etiñ. Koro idighe mbufo editiñ, edi Edisana Spirit editiñ ito ke mbufo.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Eyen eka eyetap eyen eka ọnọ ñkpa: idem mme ete eyetap idem nditọ mmọ, nditọ eyetap idem mme ete mmọ enọ man ewot <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Ndien kpukpru owo eyesua mbufo koro mbufo edide Okim. Edi mmọ emi edimede ime tutu osim akpatre, inyuñ ikañke Enyiñ Mi eyenyaña mmọ,<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Ke ini mbufo edikutde mbubiam ñkpọ nsobo adade ke esit ufọk itie ukpono Abasi yak okot ñwed, ọfiọk se ọwọrọde. Ndien mbon emi edude ke Judia enyene ndifeñe ñka ke mme obot. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Yak owo kiet ekededi emi odorode ke enyọñ ọkọm ufọk esie okusuhọde isọñ, mme ndiduk ufọk ñkemen ñkpọ ndomokiet ñwọrọ. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Yak owo emi odude ke iñwañ okufiak aka ufọk ndimen ọfọñ esie.<verse eid="MRK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Edidi ata ñkpọ ndik ye mbọm ke mme usen oro inọ mme iban idibi ye mme akama nsek nditọ. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Edi ebọñ akam ete yak okudi ke ini ukwọ. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Koro ukem mme utọ usen ukut oro edi emi akananam miduhọ toto ke ini emi Abasi okobotde ererimbot tutu osim emi, emi mbiet esie midinyuñ iduhọ aba. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ndien edieke Ọbọñ mikpọmuhọke mme usen oro, baba ukpọñ ndomokiet ikpoduho uwem ke iso isọñ. Edi ke ntak mme ndimek nditọ Esie, Enye amanam mme usen oro emuhọ.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ndien ke ini oro edieke owo ekededi edidọhọde fi ete, “Emi edi Andinyaña, mme oko edi Enye, ekunim ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Koro ediwak mme nsu nsu mme andinyaña ye mme nsu nsu prọfet eyedu emi edinamde ekese mme utibe idiọñọ emi edidide ñkpọ abiaña inọ ediwak mme ndimek ikọt Abasi edieke ekpekemede ndidi ntre. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Etim ekpeme; mmabak nduri mbufo utọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Ke mme usen ukut oro ema ebe, utin eyeduk ekim, ọfiọñ idinyuñ inọhọ aba uñwana. <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ndien mme ntantaọfiọñ eyeto ke ikpa enyọñ eduọñọ. Eyenyeñe mme odudu ke ufum enyọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />“Ntem ke ofuri ubon owo edikut Eyen Owo nte ọsuhọrede edi ke obubit enyọñ, ye akwa odudu, ye ubọñ. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Ndien Enye eyedọñ mme enjel Esie, onyuñ asat mme ndimek ikọt Esie osioño ke ituñ mbinañ ererimbot, tọñọde ke mme utit ererimbot tutu ke mme utit enyọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Kemi, eda ukpepñkpọ eto eto udari, ke ini emine ñkọk esie editibede ndien ikọñ esie onyuñ ọtọñọ ndisiaha, mbufo efiọk ete ke ndaeyo ekpere. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ndien ke ini mbufo edikutde mme ñkpọ emi ññwanade nditiñ nnọ mbufo etibede, mbufo eyekeme ndifiọk ete ke edidi Mi ke ekpere, ndien Ami ke idem enyin usuñ nda.<verse eid="MRK 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ke akpanikọ ke ndọhọ mbufo nte ke emana enyemi idibehe ifep tutu kpukpru mme ñkpọ emi eda itie. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Enyọñ ye isọñ eyebe efep, edi mme ikọ Mi eyesọñọ eda ke nsinsi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Nte ededi baba owo ndomokiet, edide mme asañautom Abasi ke enyọñ mme Eyen ke idem Esie, iduhọ emi ọfiọkde usen mme ini ñkanika emi mme ñkpọ emi editibede, ibọhọke Ete Mi ikpọñ ikpọñ ọdiọñọ. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ndien sia mbufo mifiọkke ini emi ñkpọ emi editibede, etie ke mbeñe idem. Etim ekpeme ebeñe edidi Esie.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Ekeme ndida edidi Mi edomo ye owo emi akade isañ ke anyan idut. Enye ọnọ nditọ ufọk esie utom ndinam ke ini enye edikade isañ, onyuñ ọnọ etieusuñ inua otop itie utom ñko ete etie ekpeme tutu enye ọnyọñ edi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />“Ke ntre, etiñ enyin ekpeme, koro mbufo mifiọkke ini emi enyene ufọk edinyọñde, mme edidi ke mbubreyo mme ufọt okoneyo, mme edidi ke ñkpọusen mme ke ata ufọt uwemeyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Edieke Enye edide wap inikiet ke edibabuat, kuyak Enye edikut fi nte edede idap. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ekpeme! Se ntiñde emi nnọ mbufo, ntiñ ntre nnọ kpukpru mbon efen.”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Ke emi, ọsuhọ usen iba mbemiso usọrọ ube inyañ ye eke uyo emi ibọk unam uyo ọkọri misineke. Mme ikpọ oku ye mme ekpep ibet, ke ekeyom usuñ ndimum Jisọs ke ndibe ñnyuñ ñwot enye.<verse eid="MRK 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Mmọ ema edọhọ ete, “Inaha ñnyin inam emi ke ini usọrọ ube inyañ man mme owo edisin ntime.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ke ini Jisọs okodude ke okpokoro udia ke Betani ke ufọk owo emi ekekerede Saimọn, owo akpa mfia, ñwan kiet ama oduk ye otu nsọñurua enem utebe aran. Enye ama ọkubọde otu oro, onyuñ ọtọhọ aran oro ọduọk Jisọs ke ibuot.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ndusuk mmọ emi ekedude do ema eyat esit enyuñ edọhọ ete, “Nsutọ edibiat nsọñurua aran idi emi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Utọ aran eke etiede ntre, ekem se ekpenyamde awak ebe bọn ikie ita enyuñ emen okuk oro enọ ubuene.” Mmọ ema esua eti eti enọ enye.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Edi Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ekpọñ enye, nsinam mbufo ebiomde enye ke ediye ñkpọ emi enye anamde ọnọ Mi? <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Kpukpru ini, mbufo eyenyene mme ubuene ke otu mbufo ndien emekeme ndiñwam mmọ ini ekededi emi mbufo eyomde. Edi Ami ndiduhọ ye mbufo kpukpru ini.<verse eid="MRK 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Enye anam se enye ekemede, onyuñ eyet Mi aran ke idem ebeñe ini emi edibukde Mi. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ndien ntiñ emi nnọ mbufo ke ata ofuri akpanikọ nte ebiet ekededi emi edikwọrọde Eti Mbuk emi ke ofuri ererimbot, eyetiñ ebaña edinam emi ñwan emi anamde mi, nte ñkpọ edida nti enye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Ntem ke Judas Iskariọt kiet ke otu mbet Esie ekebine mme ikpọ oku okodiomi abaña usuñ nte enye editapde Jisọs inọ mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ke ini mme ikpọ oku ekekopde ntak emi enye ebinede mmimọ, mmọ ema ekop inemesit eti eti, ema eñwọñọ ndinọ enye ñkpọ eyen utom. Ntre ke enye ọkọtọñọ ndiyom eti ini ye ebiet emi enye editapde Jisọs inọ ñkpa.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ke akpa usen usọrọ uyo emi ibọk unam uyo ọkọri misineke, mbet Jisọs ema ebup Enye ete, “Mmọñ ke edima ñnyin ikanam akpatre udia usọrọ ube inyañ?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Enye ama osio mbet Esie iba ọdọñ ete, “Eka ke esit obio, ndien mbufo eyesobo ye owo emi obiomde abañ mmọñ, etiene enye. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Eka ke ufọk emi enye edidukde, enyuñ edọhọ enyene ufọk oro ete, Andikpep ọdọhọ ete: Mmọñ ke ndidia usọrọ ube inyañ ye mbet Mi? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Enye eyeda mbufo ọdọk aka okowut akamba ubet enyọñ emi ema ekebana ọfọn etim enye ebeñe udia mbubreyo ñnyin.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Ntre mme mbet iba oro ema edaha isañ ekeduk ke obio, ema enyuñ ekekut kpukpru ñkpọ ukem ukem kpa nte Jisọs ọkọdọhọde ndien mmọ ema enam ndutim ebeñe idem edidia usọrọ ube inyañ.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Jisọs ye mbet Esie eken ema ekesim do ke mbubreyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ndien nte mmọ eketiede ke okpokoro edia ñkpọ, Jisọs ama ọdọhọ ete, “Ke akpanikọ ke ndọhọ mbufo añwa añwa nte ke owo mbufo kiet eyetap Mi, owo mbufo kiet mi emi osuk adiade ñkpọ ye Ami.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ndien kpukpru mmọ ema edu ke ọkpọsọñ mfuhọ, do owo kiet kiet ama obup Enye ete, “Ndi ami ndi owo oro?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Enye ama ọbọrọ mmọ ete, “Edi kiet ke otu mbufo owo duopeba emi ediade ñkpọ ye Ami idahaemi, owo emi edebide uyo esie usan kiet ye Ami. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Eyen owo enyene ndikpa kpa nte ñwed Abasi ama eketetiñ abaña Enye, edi, O akwa ufen emi anade ke iso ọnọ owo emi atapde Enye! Ọkpọfọn ye owo oro edieke enye mikpamanake.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ndien nte mmọ ekediade ñkpọ, Jisọs ama emen ekpri eboho uyo onyuñ ebeñe edidiọñ Abasi ọnọ enye ndien obuñ enye ñkeñe ñkeñe ọnọ mbet Esie ndien etiñ ete, “Eta, emi edi ikpọk idem Mi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Ndien Enye ñko emen kọb mmin emi ekotde wain onyuñ ọnọ Abasi ekọm abaña enye ndien ọnọ mmọ, ndien kpukpru mmọ enyuñ eñwọñ eto kọb oro. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Ndien Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, Emi edi iyip Mi emi eduọkde ke abaña ediwak owo, emi edide idiọñọ obufa ediomi ke ufọt Abasi ye owo. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ntiñ ata akpanikọ nte ke Ami ndinwoñke wain aba tutu osim usen emi Ami ndiñwọñde obufa wain ke Obio Ubọñ Abasi.<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ndien mmọ ema ekwọ ikwọ enyuñ ewọñọ eka ke Obot Ọlif.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Mbufo kpukpru eyefeñe ekpọñ Mi.” Koro Abasi ama ananam añwaña oto ke uyo mme Asiak Uduak Abasi. “Ñyewot ekpemerọñ, ndien mme erọñ eyesuana. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Edi Ami mma nset ke ñkpa ñyeka ke Kalili man ndisobo ye mbufo do.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pita ama ọdọhọ Enye ete, Ami ndikpọñke Fi ekpededi mbon eken ekpekpọñ Fi.<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jisọs ama ọdọhọ Pita ete, “Mbemiso ekikọ ọkpọk ọyọhọ ikaba usen ubọk ñkpọñ, afo eyekañ Mi utim ikata.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Pita ama ọsọñọ eyire etiñ ete, “Baba-o, idighe, ekpededi nte ana nte ñkpa ye Afo, ami ndikañke Fi.” Ndien kpukpru mbet eken ema eñwọñọ kpasuk ntre.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Mmọ edisim ebiet emi ekotde iñwañ Ketsemeni, ndien Enye ama ọdọhọ mbet Esie ete, “Etie mi kadaña emi ñkade ndibọñ akam.”<verse eid="MRK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Enye ama ada Pita ye Jems ye Jọn. Enye ama onyuñ ọtọñọ ndiyọhọ ye ọkpọsọñ ukut ye mfuhọ. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ndien Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ukpọñ Mi ọfuhọ eti eti tutu ekpere ñkpa; etie mi enyuñ ekpeme ye Ami.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Enye ama asaña aka iso esisit ndien ọduọ ọtọñọ edọñ ke isọñ onyuñ ọbọñ akam ete, edieke usuñ odude yak idiọk ini eke etiede ntem ebe ọkpọñ mi.<verse eid="MRK 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Enye ama ofiori ete, “Ete, Ete, kpukpru ñkpọ edi mmem mmem ke ubọk Fo, men kọb emi fep Mi ke iso. Ñyom uduak Fo, yak okudi okim.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ntem ke Enye akafiak ebine mbet Esie ita onyuñ okosobo mmọ nte mmọ edede idap. Enye ama ọdọhọ Pita ete, “Saimọn, ede idap? Nte mbufo ikemeke nditie ñkpeme ye Ami ke ñkpọ nte awa ñkanika kiet?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Ekpeme enyuñ ebọñ akam man andidiọk edidomo mbufo. Okposuk edi emi ke akpanikọ Spirit onyimede, edi obukidem edi mmem mmem.<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ndien Enye ama ọtọñọ ntak afiak ọkọbọñ akam, aka iso osuk ekpe Abasi ubọk ke ukem usuñ emi Enye eketiñde. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ekem Enye afiak edi, edikut nte mmọ esuk edede, koro mmọ ekekpade mba. Ndien mmọ ikọfiọkke se mmọ ekpekemede nditiñ nnọ Enye.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ke ọyọhọ ikata ke ini Enye akafiakde edikut mmọ, Enye ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Nte mbufo ke edede idap enyuñ ebọ nduọk odudu? Ekem ndien! Ini idap ama okure. Sese! emetap Eyen owo esin mme ndiọi owo ke ubọk. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Edaha eda, eyak ñnyin ika. Sese, anditap Mi kasaña edi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ndien idaha oro, ke adaña emi Enye okosuk etiñde ikọ, Judas (kiet ke otu mbet Esie) ama edisim ye otu owo emi ekekamade akañkañ (ofut) ye mbio eto, emi ikpọ oku ye mme ekpep ibet ye mme ikpọ owo mme Ju ekedọñde.<verse eid="MRK 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Judas ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Mbufo eyediọñọ Enye emi mbufo edimumde ke adaña ini emi edikutde nte ntimde Enye inua. Ntem emum Enye eda edaha ke idak ukpeme.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ntre, ke ini emi mmọ ekesimde do, Judas ama asaña ini kiet ebine Jisọs, okot Enye, “Eteufọk!” Ndien otim Enye inua. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Ntem ke otu owo ekemum Jisọs, ndien emum Enye ubọk ọsọñ <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Edi owo akadade ekpere oduri akañkañ esie osio ke efọk onyuñ adiañade eyen ufọk akwa oku utọñ esie efep.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Jisọs ama obup mmọ ete, “Nte Ami ndi owo ñwo, emi anamde mbufo ewọñọ edi ntem, esaña ye kpukpru ñkpọ ekọñ emi man emum Mi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ntak emi mbufo mikemumke Mi ke adaña ini emi ñkodude ye mbufo ke itie ukpono Abasi-e? Ñkodu do ñkpep ñkpọ kpukpru usen. Edi kpukpru ñkpọ emi etibe man kpukpru se mme oku Abasi eset eketiñde ebaña Mi ekeme ndisu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ke ntem mbet Esie ema efeñe ekpọñ Enye. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Ama odu akparawa kiet do emi ekesinede ñkisi ọfọñidem etiene Jisọs ke edem, ke ini emi mmọ ekemumde Enye. <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Enye ama emen itọk efehe ọkpọñ ọfọñ esie.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Mmọ ema eda Jisọs eka ufọk Akwa oku ebiet emi ikpọ oku ye mme ekpep ibet ye ikpọ owo mme Ju ekesobode idem ọtọ kiet idaha oro. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pita ama asaña etiene mmọ ke ata edem edem onyuñ ebe nnen nnen okoduk esit okure Akwa oku, ndien ọsuhọde etetie ewebe ikañ ye mme nditọ ufọk eken.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ke esit okure oro mme ikpọ oku ye ofuri esop mme ebiere ikpe mme Ju ema etie do eñwana ndiyom se ekpetiñde man enye odot isop ñkpa. Edi kpukpru mbufiọk mmọ ọkọwọrọ ikpuikpu. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Ediwak ntiense nsu ema ewọñọ editiñ nsu nsu ikọ edian Enye, edi kpukpru uyoikọ mmọ ekedi nsio nsio.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Ke akpatre, ndusuk mme owo ema edaha eda enyuñ etiñ nsu nsu ikọ edian Enye ete, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“ñnyin ima ikop nte Enye ọkọdọhọde ete ke Imọ iyewuri itie ukpono Abasi emi ubọk owo ọkọbọpde ndien ke ọyọhọ usen ita iyebọp obufa emi baba ubọk owo ndomokiet midisineke.” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Edi kpa ye oro ekedide ntre, mmọ ikekemeke ndinyene nnen nnen ikọ.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ntem ke Akwa Oku akadaha ada ke enyọñ ke ufọk esop, onyuñ obup Jisọs ete, “Nte Afo unyeneke ibọrọ ka baña kpukpru se etiñde edian Fi emi? Nso ke Afo enyene nditiñ ñnyaña idem Fo?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ke otu kpukpru mme mbume emi, Jisọs ikamaha ndinọ enye ibọrọ. Ntem ke Akwa Oku ọkọtọñọ ntak obup ete, “Nte Afo edi Andinyaña, Eyen Mfọnmma Abasi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jisọs ama ọbọrọ enye ete, Ami ndi Enye, “Ndien afo eyekut Eyen owo nte etiede ke ubọk nnasia Abasi, andikeme ndinam kpukpru ñkpọ, ye nte edide ke obubit ikpa enyọñ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Ntem ke akwa oku akawai ọfọñ idem esie, onyuñ ọdọhọ ete, “Ufọn ediyom ntiense efen iduhọ.” <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mbufo emekop nte Enye osuñide Abasi, nso idi ubiere ikpe mbufo? Kpukpru owo ema emenede ubọk enyime ete ke Enye odot ñkpa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Ntem ke ndusuk mmọ eketọñọ ndifiari Enye etap ke iso enyuñ efuk Enye iso ndien etọñọ ndituak Enye, ete Enye, “Kere ise, anie owo eketuak Fi?” Mmọ ema esak Enye. Idem mme isuñutom ufọk esop ema etiene emia Enye nte mmọ ekedade Enye ewọrọ ke esop.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Kaña ke emi, Pita okodu ke ata esit okure esop, kiet ke otu nditọ iban emi ekenamde ñkpọ ke ufọk akwa oku, ama asaña ekpere Pita. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Ke ini enye okokutde Pita nte ewebede ikañ, onyuñ ọdọhọ enye ete, “Afo ama etiene odu ye Jisọs emi otode Nasaret.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Pita ama akañ Jisọs, onyuñ ọdọhọ ete, “Mfiọkke se afo etiñde abaña,” ndien asaña ọwọrọ ke inua otop esit okure. Ke ndo ndo oro ekikọ unen ama ọkpọk.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ke ini eyenañwan oro okokutde nte enye adade do, enye ama ọtọñọ nditiñ nnọ mbon efen emi ekedade do ete, “Se enye ko! Enye edi kiet ke otu mmọ oro.”<verse eid="MRK 14:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pita ama afiak akañ Enye. Ke ñkpọ nte esisit ini ama ekebe mbon eñwen emi ekedade ekpere do ema etọñọ nditiñ ye Pita ete, “Afo edi kiet ke otu mmọ, koro afo ñko oto Kalili.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Enye ama ọtọñọ ndisuñi idem ñnyuñ ññwọñọ ñkpọ ete, “Ami ndiọñọke owo emi mbufo etiñde mi ebaña.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ndien idaha oro ekikọ ama ọkpọk ọyọhọ ikaba. Ndien inikiet, Pita ama eti ikọ emi Jisọs ọkọdọhọde ete, “Mbemiso ekikọ ọkpọk ikaba, afo eyekañ Mi utim ikata.” Ndien enye ama ọtọñọ nditua eyet.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ke ata usen ubọk, mme ikpọ oku, ye mme ikpọ owo, ye mme andikpep ido ukpono Abasi mmọ ye ofuri esop Ayara Iwat mme Ju, ema esop idem ọtọ kiet enyuñ ediomi se mmọ enyenede ndinam. Mmọ ema ebiere ndinọ mbon ekọñ ekeda Jisọs ye ñkpọkọbi ke ubọk esọk Pailet ada ibuot ukara mbon Rom.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pailet ama obup Enye ete, “Nte Afo edi Edidem mme Ju?” Jisọs ama ọbọrọ enye ete, “Ih, edi kpa nte afo ọdọhọde.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Mme ikpọ oku ema edori Jisọs ikọ ke ediwak mme nsio nsio ñkpọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pailet ama afiak obup Enye ete, “Nte Afo uyomke ndibọrọ? Se adaña ediwak ñkpọ emi etiñde edian fi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Edi Jisọs ikọbọrọke enye aba, emi ama anam Pailet odu ke ñkpaidem.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ndien ekesidi edu unam ñkpọ Pailet ndisana owo ñkpọkọbi kiet ñyak nnọ mme Ju kpukpru isua ke ini usọrọ ube inyañ, oro edi, owo ñkpọkọbi kiet ekededi emi kpukpru owo ebeñede enye ete asana ayak. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Owo kiet ama odu ke otu mbon ñkpọkọbi ke ini oro emi ekekerede Barabas, emi ekebierede ikpe ñkpa enọ enye ye mbon efen ke ntak emi mmọ ekewotde owo.<verse eid="MRK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Otu owo ema esaña etiene Pailet, enyuñ ekedọhọ enye ete, yak enye asana owo ñkpọkọbi kiet ayak nte esidide.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pailet ama obup mmọ ete, “Nte emeyom mi nsana Edidem mme Ju ñyak nnọ mbufo?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Koro enye ama ọdiọñọ ke idem esie ete ke okoto ke ntak ufup akanam mme ikpọ oku eyak Jisọs enọ imọ.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Edi ke nde emi, mme ikpọ oku ema etimede esit otu owo ete yak mmọ ebeñe Pailet ndisana Barabas ñyak utu ke esana Jisọs eyak.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pailet ama obup mmọ ete, “Edieke nsanade Barabas ñyak, Eyom mi nnam nso ye owo emi ekotde Edidem mme Ju?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Mmọ ema efiak efiori! Kọñ Enye ke Krọs!<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pailet ama obup mmọ ete, “Nso idi ntak? Nso idiọkñkpọ ke Enye anam? Mmọ ema eka iso efiori ete, Kọñ Enye ke Krọs.”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pailet ke ufehe enyin, ye ñko ke ndinem otu owo esit ama asana Barabas ye uwem ayak ọnọ mmọ. Ndien ke enye ama akamia Jisọs, ama asana Enye ayak ọnọ mmọ ekọñ ke Krọs.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Mbon ekọñ ema eda Jisọs eduk esit badik, oro edi okure ada ibuot ukara, enyuñ ekot kpukpru mbon ekọñ eken ete edi. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Mmọ ema esine enye ididuot ọfọñidem, enyuñ edọk anyanya ñkukim eyari Enye ke ibuot. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ntem ke mmọ ekekọm, enyuñ eyomo Enye ete, “Itọñ uwem akpakam ọsọñ edidem mme Ju ke nsinsi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Ndien mmọ ema eda eto emia Enye ke ibuot, enyuñ efiari Enye etap, ndien etọñọ edọñ ke nsahi enọ Enye ndikpono Enye.<verse eid="MRK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ke ini mmọ ema ekekpa mba ke edida Enye ntọ ndọk, ema esio Enye ididuot ọfọñidem, enyuñ efiak esine Enye ọfọñidem Esie, ndien eda Enye ewọrọ eka ndikọñ ke Krọs.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Ke usuñ, mmọ ema esobo owo emi ekekerede Saimọn, emi okotode akwa obio edi, ndien mmọ ema enyik enye ndibiom Krọs Jisọs. (Saimọn emi ekedi owo Sirin, ete Aleksanda ye Rufọs).<verse eid="MRK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Ndien mmọ ema eda Jisọs ekesim ebiet emi ekerede Kọlkọta, emi ọwọrọde ebiet ñkpọkpọrọ. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Do, mmọ ema enọ Enye mmin emi ekebuakde idot idot ibọk, Enye ama esin ndibọ mmọ ññwọñ. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ntem ke mmọ ekekọñ Enye ke eto, enyuñ esin afia ebaña ọfọñidem Esie man efiọk se owo kiet kiet enyenede ndida.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ekedi ke ñkpọ nte ñkanika usukkiet usen ubọk ke ekekọñ Enye ke Krọs.<verse eid="MRK 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ema enam obukpọk idiọñọ ke Krọs, ke enyọñ ibuot Esie, nditiñ idiọkñkpọ Esie. Ekewet ete:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">
    <char style="sc">“Edidem mme Ju”.</char><verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Ema ekọñ mbon ñwo iba ñko kpa ke usen ubọk oro ke Krọs, kiet ke ubọk ufien, enyeken ke ubọk nnasia. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ndien ntre ikọ ñwed Abasi ama osu, emi ekewetde ete, “Ema ebat Enye esin ke otu mme ndiọi owo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mmọ emi ekesañade ebe ema etop ibuot ke ido usọñenyin ebaña Jisọs ete, “Ha! Afo emi ekemede ndiwuri itie ukpono Abasi, ñnyuñ mbọp enye ke usen ita. <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Ke emi nyaña idem fo, nyuñ kọñọde ke Krọs di-e.”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Mme ikpọ oku ye mme ekpep ibet ñko ema etiene eda Enye etọ ndọk, ndien edọhọ ke otu mmọ ete, “Enye ọdiọñọ ndinyaña mbon eñwen edi ikemeke ndinyaña idem Esie?”<verse eid="MRK 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Yak Kraist emi, Edidem Isrel, ọsuhọde ke Krọs edi idaha emi ñnyin ikut, ndien ñnyin iyenim Enye ke akpanikọ. Mbio inọ iba emi ekekọñde ke Krọs ye Jisọs, ema enyuñ esọñọ enyin ye Enye ñko:<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ekem ke ñkpọ nte ufọt uwemeyo, ekim ama ofuk ofuri iso isọñ, ndien ebighi tutu osim ñkanika ita uwemeyo.<verse eid="MRK 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ke ñkanika ita, Jisọs ama ofiori ke ọkpọsọñ uyo ete, “Elai, Elai, Lema Sabaktani?” Emi ọwọrọde “Abasi Mi, Abasi Mi, nsinam Afo ọkpọñde Mi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Ke ini ndusuk mme owo emi ekedade ekpere do ekekopde emi, mmọ ema edọhọ ete, “Ekpañ utọñ, Enye kokot Elaiya,” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />ntre ke owo mmọ kiet ekefehe akada kusa edebi ke ndot ndot mmin ndien otori ke eto emenede owuk Jisọs ke inua, ndien ọdọhọ ete, “Eyak ise mme Elaiya eyesuhọde edi edikọñọde Enye ke eto efep.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ntem ke Jisọs akafiak ofiori ñkpo efen, ndien asana ukpọñ Esie ayak.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ndien ikpehe esit itie ukpono Abasi ama asiaha ke mbak iba, ọtọñọde ke enyọñ tutu osim isọñ.<verse eid="MRK 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Ke ini etubom mbon ekọñ Rom emi akadade ekpere Krọs oro okokutde adaña nte Jisọs akayakde ukpọñ Esie enye ama ọdọhọ ete, “Ke akpanikọ, owo emi ekedi Eyen Abasi.”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Ndusuk iban ema eda nsan nsan ese; oro edi Meri Makdalin, Meri (eka Jems) emi ekedide ekpri ye Josef ye Salome, ye mbon eñwen. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Mme iban emi eketiene Enye tọñọ ke Kalili, enyuñ enam ñkpọ enọ Enye. Ediwak iban efen emi eketienede Enye edi Jerusalem ema enyuñ etiene edu do ñko.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ñkpọ emi eketibe ke usen emi esierede Sabat (usen ikọ Abasi mme Ju). Usen emi ekedi usen ntimidem. Anam kadaña emi ekekperede mbubreyo, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Josef emi ekotde Arimatia, owo kiet ke otu mme etie esop Ayara Iwat mme Ju (emi enye ke idem esie eketiede ebet Obio Ubọñ Abasi) ama oduk uko uko etiene Pailet onyuñ ekebeñe enye okpo Jisọs.<verse eid="MRK 15:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pailet ama odu ke ñkpaidem ndikop ke Jisọs akpakpa, ke ntre enye ama ọdọñ ekekot etubom mbon ekọñ emi esede mbon ukpeme ndien obup enye mme ebighi Jisọs akakpa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Kini Etubom ekọñ eketiñde ete ke edi akpanikọ, Pailet ama ọdọhọ Josef ete ke enye ekeme ndikimen okpo Esie.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Josef ama edep ata ediye mmem mmem ọfọñ, ndien ke ini enye ama ọkọkọñọde okpo Jisọs ke Krọs, enye ama awañ Enye ke ọfọñ oro, onyuñ obuk Enye ke udi emi ekebotde ke itiat, ndien enye akpat itiat eberi ke inua esie.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Meri Makdalin ye Meri eka Josef mmọdo ekeda ese, ema enyuñ ekut ebiet emi ekenimde Jisọs.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ke usen ikọ Abasi mme Ju ama ekebe, Meri Makdalin ye Meri eka Jems ye Salome ema edep enem utebe aran man mmọ eda ekeyet ke okpo Jisọs. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ke tughi tughi usen ubọk Ederi, mbemiso utin asiaha, mmọ ema emen aran oro eka ke udi. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Edi ke usuñ, mmọ ema ebup kiet eken ete, mme anie edikeme ndikpat ndodobi itiat oro nsio ke inua udi.<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Edi kadaña emi mmọ ema ekesim do, mmọ ema emenede enyin ese enyuñ ekut ete ke ema ekpat ata ndodobi itiat oro efep, ndien ke inua udi akana iñwañ. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ke mmọ ema ekesaña esim udi, mmọ ema ekut akparawa emi ekesinede afia ọfọñidem nte etiede ke mben ñkañ ubọk nnasia, lban emi ema ekop ọkpọsọñ ndik. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Edi enjel oro ama ọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Ekuyak idem akpa mbufo, mmọdiọñọ nte mbufo eyom Jisọs emi otode Nasaret, emi ekekọñde ke Krọs. Enye iduhọ mi, Enye ama eset ke ñkpa! Ese ebiet emi ekenimde Enye mi. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Idahaemi enyọñọ enyuñ eda etop emi eketiñ enọ mme mbet Esie ye Pita ñko. Enye eyebem mbufo iso aka Kalili. Mbufo eyekut Enye do, nte Enye ọkọdọhọde mbufo mbemiso Enye akpa.”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Iban oro ema efeñe ekpọñ udi oto ke ọkpọsọñ ñnyekidem ye ñkpaidem, ndik ama anam mmọ tutu ikekemeke ndisioro uyo ntiñ ikọ nnọ owo ndomokiet.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Ke akpa usen ke urua, ke ini Jisọs ama ekeset ke ñkpa, Enye ama ebem iso ayarade idem Esie owut Meri Makdalin, ñwan emi Enye ekebinde ndiọi spirit itiaba osioño ke idem. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Enye ama okobuk ọnọ mmọ emi ekedude ye Jisọs. Kpukpru mmọ ekedu ke mfuhọ ye ntuaña. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ke ini mmọ ekekopde ete ke Jisọs ama eset ke ñkpa, ñko ke Meri ama okut Enye, mmọ ikenimke ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ke ñkpọ nte esisit ini ama ekebe kpa ke usen oro, Jisọs ama ayarade idem Esie ke usuñ efen, ọnọ owo iba emi eketode Jerusalem edi idut oro.<verse eid="MRK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Edi ke mmọ ema ekediọñọ Enye ke akpatre, mmọ ema efiak efehe eka Jerusalem man eketiñ enọ mbon eken. Edi baba owo kiet ikenimke se mmọ eketiñde ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ke akpatre ndien, Enye ama ayarade idem esie ọnọ mbet Esie duopekiet ke ini emi mmọ eketiede ọtọ kiet edia ñkpọ. Enye ama asua ọnọ mmọ ke unana mbuọtidem ye nsọñibuot mmọ ke editre ndinim ke akpanikọ se mme owo emi ekekutde Enye esetde ke ñkpa eketiñde.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ndien ntem ke Enye ọkọdọhọ mmọ ete, “Mbufo enyene ndisaña nduk ofuri ererimbot, ñnyuñ ñkwọrọ Eti Mbuk nnọ kpukpru owo, ke kpukpru ebiet. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Mmọ emi enimde ke akpanikọ enyuñ enade babtisim, eyebọ edinyaña. Edi ama edi mmọ emi etrede ndinim ke akpanikọ eyebiere ikpe ñkpa enọ mmọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Ndien mme idiọñọ emi eyetiene mme andinim ke akpanikọ: mmọ eyebin ndiọi spirit esioño ke Enyiñ Mi, mmọ eyesem usem ke mme esen edeme. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Mmọ ñko eyekeme ndimum urukikọt edi ñkpọ idinamke mmọ, ekpeñwọñwọñ bọisin kiet ekededi, enye idinamke mmọ baba ñkpọ ndomokiet, ndien mmọ eyenyene odudu ndidori mbon udọñọ ubọk ke idem, ndien enam udọñọ mmọ okure.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Kini Ọbọñ Jisọs ama eketiñ ikọ ye mmọ ama, ema emen Enye edọk ke enyọñ ndien Enye ọkọsuhọde etie ke ubọk nnasia Abasi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ndien mme mbet Esie ema esaña ekanade kpukpru ebiet ekwọrọ ikọ Abasi, ndien Ọbọñ ama asaña ye mmọ onyuñ ọsọñọ se mmọ eketiñde ke edinam ediwak mme utibe ñkpọ ye mme idiọñọ.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>